Put your face on the floor
Is your front tooth broken?

8
00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:04.467
(Sanghyeon) Yes

9
00:01:04.534 --> 00:01:05.400
(Sabi) So

10
00:01:05.467 --> 00:01:06.633
