11
00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.300
This is a crown

12
00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:09.707
[Humorous sound effects]

13
00:01:09.774 --> 00:01:11.638
When intubating the trachea
Because it might break

14
00:01:11.705 --> 00:01:13.206
I'll give you one more notice

15
00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:14.534
(Sanghyun) Yes, I’ll be careful.

16
00:01:14.601 --> 00:01:15.642
thank you

17
00:01:17.077 --> 00:01:18.378
Are you going to start?

18
00:01:18.445 --> 00:01:19.780
(Sanghyun) Yes, I’m ready.

19
00:01:20.647 --> 00:01:21.845
Not yet

20
00:01:21.912 --> 00:01:24.651
(Sanghyun) Please tell me when you’re ready.
The anesthesia is ready.

21
00:01:24.718 --> 00:01:26.685
(Barley) Okay, I’ll finish it.

22
00:01:28.555 --> 00:01:29.511
I...

23
00:01:30.324 --> 00:01:32.139
I want to go back again

24
00:01:33.427 --> 00:01:34.995
[Rewind sound effect]

25
00:01:35.062 --> 00:01:37.063
(Junmo) Hey, I hope the pathological test results come out.

26
00:01:37.130 --> 00:01:39.646
Organize that
Shouldn’t you send it to me?

27
00:01:39.713 --> 00:01:40.914
(Sabi) I’m sorry
[Sabi’s cough]

28
00:01:41.467 --> 00:01:43.133
(Junmo) How do you organize cervical cancer data?

29
00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:45.100
(Sabi) I was planning to send you an email today.

30
00:01:45.167 --> 00:01:46.706
(Junmo) Oh, that

31
00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.901
Added patient data
Did you include everything?

32
00:01:48.968 --> 00:01:50.410
(Sabi) Oh, that’s...

33
00:01:51.879 --> 00:01:53.058
(Junmo) What, it’s not included?

34
00:01:54.581 --> 00:01:55.911
Oh my, Mr!

35
00:01:58.383 --> 00:01:59.486
Oh, that

36
00:01:59.987 --> 00:02:01.674
Organize it and send it by tomorrow

37
00:02:02.567 --> 00:02:03.700
[Sabi’s labored breathing]

38
00:02:03.767 --> 00:02:04.991
(Sabi) Until tomorrow?

39
00:02:05.058 --> 00:02:06.894
(Junmo) Oh, even if you are late
I have to send it by tomorrow

40
00:02:06.961 --> 00:02:08.395
I put it in my thesis
Are you going to add more?

41
00:02:08.462 --> 00:02:09.530
[Thump sound]

42
00:02:10.797 --> 00:02:12.500
Hey, you, why? hey! Come here, quickly!
[dark music]

43
00:02:12.567 --> 00:02:13.867
Come here, hey, Sabi!

44
00:02:13.934 --> 00:02:15.102
Sabi Kim, hey, why are you like this?

45
00:02:15.169 --> 00:02:16.904
Hey, Sabi, hey

46
00:02:18.171 --> 00:02:19.734
[Sabi’s labored breathing]

47
00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:21.300
(Jaehwi) Uh...

48
00:02:21.367 --> 00:02:22.609
This

49
00:02:27.167 --> 00:02:29.182
Should I have surgery?

50
00:02:29.249 --> 00:02:30.100
(Japan) Surgery?

51
00:02:30.167 --> 00:02:32.085
- (Namgyeong) Laparoscopy, right?
- (Lee Young) Are you serious?

52
00:02:32.152 --> 00:02:33.033
(Japan) How much is fibroid?

53
00:02:33.100 --> 00:02:34.300
(Nanjing) It’s not malignant cancer, right?

54
00:02:34.367 --> 00:02:35.522
(Lee Young) It looks a lot bigger.

55
00:02:36.156 --> 00:02:37.591
(Dowon) Professor...
[Ultrasonic machine operating sound]

56
00:02:39.059 --> 00:02:41.361
Hey, wait a minute.

57
00:02:41.428 --> 00:02:42.642
(Japan, Nankyung) Uh, hello?

58
00:02:42.709 --> 00:02:43.997
(Dowon) Aren’t you all busy?

59
00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:45.699
The professor's lab results came out.

60
00:02:45.766 --> 00:02:48.767
It came out as hemoglobin 6.2.
First, I prescribed two packs of RBC.

61
00:02:48.834 --> 00:02:50.470
(Jaehwi) Oh my gosh

62
00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:53.299
It must have been really dizzy, right?

63
00:02:53.801 --> 00:02:54.808
[light sigh]

64
00:02:54.875 --> 00:02:56.133
(Dowon) I contacted the anesthesiology department.

65
00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.712
Tomorrow, last time in room 3
I heard it was canceled. What should I do?

66
00:02:59.613 --> 00:03:00.693
What should I do?

67
00:03:02.649 --> 00:03:04.199
huh? Resident patient?

68
00:03:07.701 --> 00:03:09.556
[Calm music]

69
00:03:09.623 --> 00:03:11.626
(Jaehwi) You better do it, it’s too big

70
00:03:13.126 --> 00:03:14.194
Let's have surgery

71
00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:20.000
(Japan) Through abdominal ultrasound
If fibroids are visible

72
00:03:20.067 --> 00:03:21.501
Isn't it really big?

73
00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:22.335
Didn’t it hurt?

74
00:03:22.402 --> 00:03:23.367
(Nankyung) It doesn’t hurt

75
00:03:23.434 --> 00:03:25.567
A few months ago because of menstrual cramps.
I lived and died.

76
00:03:25.634 --> 00:03:28.217
You say I
I told you to get tested quickly, right?

77
00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:30.677
I felt dizzy and took a lot of medicine.

78
00:03:30.744 --> 00:03:33.413
Anemia due to bleeding
Why do you take headache medicine?

79
00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.300
So, huh?
Look at other people’s charts until you memorize them

80
00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:38.151
I don't even think about taking care of my body.

81
00:03:38.218 --> 00:03:39.219
Hey

82
00:03:39.286 --> 00:03:41.221
Is it bad, are you worried?
Just do one thing

83
00:03:41.755 --> 00:03:44.024
(Residence in Japan) Not yet
He's upset because he can't work.

84
00:03:44.891 --> 00:03:47.027
[Sound of door opening]

85
00:03:47.094 --> 00:03:48.333
(together) Hello?

86
00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:49.233
[Dahye sighs]

87
00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:50.998
(Dahye) You understand without me explaining the details, right?

88
00:03:51.065 --> 00:03:52.734
[Sound of door closing]
What about fasting?

89
00:03:52.801 --> 00:03:54.601
(Nanjing) I did it.
I didn't even drink a sip of water.

90
00:03:54.668 --> 00:03:56.036
No medications taken

91
00:03:56.103 --> 00:03:57.500
I also got all the signatures on the consent form.

92
00:03:57.567 --> 00:03:58.805
The guardian is me.

93
00:03:58.872 --> 00:04:01.341
He said he didn't tell his mom.
I think I'll be more tired if my mom finds out.

94
00:04:02.235 --> 00:04:03.066
[Dahye sighs]

95
00:04:03.133 --> 00:04:04.544
(Dahye) Yes, then

96
00:04:05.225 --> 00:04:06.579
(Japan) Teacher?

97
00:04:06.646 --> 00:04:08.734
We were together until we were anesthetized...

98
00:04:08.801 --> 00:04:09.783
(Dahye) No.

99
00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.367
How much noise are you going to make by going in?

100
00:04:11.434 --> 00:04:12.467
(Namkyung) Ah, teacher

101
00:04:12.534 --> 00:04:13.734
He says he's so scary

102
00:04:13.801 --> 00:04:17.133
(Dahye) Oh, I used to go there all the time.
This is a surgery you see every day. What are you afraid of?

103
00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:19.333
Oh, it's okay, I'll take care of everything.

104
00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:20.500
Oh, let go, let go.

105
00:04:20.567 --> 00:04:22.596
- (Residence in Japan) Just once...
- (Dahye) Oh, let’s go!

106
00:04:26.000 --> 00:04:28.000
[Pass recognition sound]

107
00:04:28.602 --> 00:04:30.170
Oh, please go, please!

108
00:04:30.237 --> 00:04:31.805
Oh, really
[Interesting music]

109
00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:34.608
(Jae-il) Get healthy!

110
00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.185
(Nankyung) Now, you know how to write, right?

111
00:04:46.732 --> 00:04:47.933
Namkyung Pyo

112
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:49.890
(Namkyung) Oh, how am I? I forgot.

113
00:04:49.957 --> 00:04:51.091
(Sabi) Ah...

114
00:04:52.526 --> 00:04:53.359
Why you?

115
00:04:53.426 --> 00:04:54.834
(Nanjing) Me? I'm on duty

116
00:04:54.901 --> 00:04:56.730
- Who is Teacher Eunmi?
- (Nanjing) Um, obstetric surgery.

117
00:04:56.797 --> 00:04:58.623
- What about Teacher Gu Do-won?
- (Nanjing) Delivery room

118
00:05:00.767 --> 00:05:02.569
- Hey
- (Savi) Rather Oh I-young

119
00:05:02.636 --> 00:05:04.438
He's good at handling things, huh?

120
00:05:05.572 --> 00:05:07.941
hey! Oh Yiyoung!

121
00:05:08.008 --> 00:05:10.544
Lee Young-ah!

122
00:05:15.516 --> 00:05:16.432
(Jaeil) What’s wrong?

123
00:05:17.584 --> 00:05:18.785
(Lee Young) No

124
00:05:18.852 --> 00:05:19.853
I'm hearing hallucinations

125
00:05:22.289 --> 00:05:23.657
(Japan) Sabi will be okay, right?

126
00:05:23.724 --> 00:05:24.933
(Lee Young) Ah, it’s okay

127
00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:26.326
It's not even a major surgery.

128
00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:28.287
(Sanghyun) The medicine is starting.

129
00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.300
[Dreamy music]

130
00:05:42.042 --> 00:05:44.644
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
'Life as a Major' theme song]

131
00:05:52.052 --> 00:05:54.688
[bird chirping]

132
00:05:54.755 --> 00:05:56.757
(Dahye) Miss...

133
00:05:58.000 --> 00:05:59.259
(Eunmi) Why again?

134
00:05:59.326 --> 00:06:01.161
What else don't you like?

135
00:06:01.228 --> 00:06:02.195
[Dahye's awkward laughter]

136
00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.164
(Dahye) No.

137
00:06:07.701 --> 00:06:09.135
- No
- (Eunmi) Yes

138
00:06:09.202 --> 00:06:11.767
If it's one year, come out a little early, huh?

139
00:06:11.834 --> 00:06:13.467
Let’s go for a round first

140
00:06:13.534 --> 00:06:15.300
Ah, before the rounds, to the senior officer.

141
00:06:15.367 --> 00:06:18.412
How about giving me a briefing in advance?
Do you like it? Oh no

142
00:06:18.479 --> 00:06:20.500
(Dahye) Oh, I don’t know that, that

143
00:06:20.567 --> 00:06:22.249
What's the point of not paying for work?

144
00:06:22.883 --> 00:06:23.850
[Dahye makes a yuck sound]

145
00:06:23.917 --> 00:06:24.901
(Dahye) I see.

146
00:06:24.968 --> 00:06:26.219
[Dahye's light smile]

147
00:06:27.588 --> 00:06:29.689
Write, ah, but

148
00:06:29.756 --> 00:06:31.958
Don’t you feel a bit empty today?

149
00:06:32.025 --> 00:06:33.794
- yes? Are you like that too?
- (Dahye) Yes

150
00:06:33.861 --> 00:06:36.356
Oh, did you check everything that needs to be handed over?

151
00:06:37.634 --> 00:06:39.599
Is it because Teacher Kim Sa-bi was hospitalized?

152
00:06:39.666 --> 00:06:41.101
Oh, I don't feel that way

153
00:06:42.069 --> 00:06:43.069
(Eunmi) What time is it now?

154
00:06:44.571 --> 00:06:45.475
uh?

155
00:06:46.406 --> 00:06:47.379
uh? None

156
00:06:49.776 --> 00:06:51.587
Huh? Wow, there really isn’t one?

157
00:06:52.546 --> 00:06:53.667
(Dahye) What is it?

158
00:06:53.734 --> 00:06:54.815
Mr. Gu Do-won

159
00:06:55.300 --> 00:06:56.716
[light music]
(Dahye) Huh?

160
00:06:57.200 --> 00:06:58.251
Oh, really?

161
00:06:58.318 --> 00:07:01.267
No, is it raining, snowing, or windy?

162
00:07:01.334 --> 00:07:03.076
(Eunmi) Do I have to be here at this time?

163
00:07:04.224 --> 00:07:05.392
What's going on?

164
00:07:06.493 --> 00:07:07.587
Where does it hurt?

165
00:07:13.466 --> 00:07:15.034
(Lee Young) Can I play music?

166
00:07:15.101 --> 00:07:17.070
(Dowon) Play it
You have Bluetooth connected.

167
00:07:17.801 --> 00:07:18.738
(Lee Young) Wow

168
00:07:22.242 --> 00:07:24.010
[music sounds]

169
00:07:25.045 --> 00:07:26.279
But what's going on?

170
00:07:27.936 --> 00:07:30.217
No, at 4:30 in the morning
A person who sharpens like a sword

171
00:07:30.284 --> 00:07:32.419
Why at this time
Are you going to work with me?

172
00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.254
(Dowon) Ah!

173
00:07:35.121 --> 00:07:36.189
I overslept

174
00:07:36.934 --> 00:07:37.857
[Lee Young’s surprised gasp]

175
00:07:37.924 --> 00:07:39.826
Do you know how to do things like that, my in-laws?

176
00:07:39.893 --> 00:07:40.894
[laughter]

177
00:07:41.728 --> 00:07:43.424
I had a lot of baggage, but it was okay.

178
00:07:46.277 --> 00:07:47.867
They won't even send me home

179
00:07:47.934 --> 00:07:50.036
(Lee Young) With socks
They don’t even give me time to wash my underwear.

180
00:07:50.103 --> 00:07:53.500
Ha, why did I major?
I thought you said you were a resident?

181
00:07:53.567 --> 00:07:55.300
very live in hospital

182
00:07:55.367 --> 00:07:56.743
I don't know why I have a house

183
00:07:58.879 --> 00:08:00.380
You don't have a home
[Lee Young’s surprised moan]

184
00:08:01.148 --> 00:08:02.667
I also had a home, right?

185
00:08:02.734 --> 00:08:04.351
18 pyeong officetel, also on lease basis

186
00:08:06.186 --> 00:08:08.088
But I was really curious

187
00:08:08.922 --> 00:08:10.323
What about that deposit?

188
00:08:10.991 --> 00:08:12.626
I went to a good place

189
00:08:14.428 --> 00:08:16.663
(Dowon) But the local hospital
Why did you quit?

190
00:08:17.133 --> 00:08:19.432
(Lee Young) Just for various reasons

191
00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:20.533
Then that...

192
00:08:21.901 --> 00:08:23.169
How much is a barrel?

193
00:08:23.236 --> 00:08:25.872
Oh, I changed my front seat this month.

194
00:08:25.939 --> 00:08:28.567
Now minus 29,708,000 won

195
00:08:28.634 --> 00:08:30.097
Oh, that's amazing!

196
00:08:31.345 --> 00:08:32.779
But why am I suddenly curious about that?

197
00:08:33.440 --> 00:08:34.388
yes?

198
00:08:35.196 --> 00:08:36.983
No, we've been living together for over a year

199
00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.318
You never asked me

200
00:08:40.887 --> 00:08:41.955
Did you?

201
00:08:44.791 --> 00:08:45.782
Maybe

202
00:08:47.561 --> 00:08:48.556
What is it?

203
00:08:52.599 --> 00:08:54.367
Do you think I should borrow some money?

204
00:08:54.434 --> 00:08:55.669
[laughter]

205
00:08:56.333 --> 00:08:58.133
Where is the money I want to lend you?

206
00:08:58.200 --> 00:08:59.438
[light laughter]

207
00:09:01.241 --> 00:09:04.233
Ah, in this next alley
Please stop just once, I have something to buy.

208
00:09:04.300 --> 00:09:05.387
(Dowon) Yes

209
00:09:16.323 --> 00:09:17.791
- (Lee Young) I’ll be right back.
- (Dowon) Yes

210
00:09:20.534 --> 00:09:22.262
[cell phone ringing sound]

211
00:09:40.767 --> 00:09:42.238
(Lee Young) I stopped by.

212
00:09:42.305 --> 00:09:43.950
A lot of sauce for the food I always eat

213
00:09:44.017 --> 00:09:46.419
Thanks, I already wanted to eat this

214
00:09:47.187 --> 00:09:48.288
(Sabi) I’ll eat it later

215
00:09:48.834 --> 00:09:49.933
(Namkyung) Oh, Sabiya.

216
00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.759
Because of the side effects of painkillers in the early morning
You said it was harsh?

217
00:09:52.826 --> 00:09:53.693
Are you okay now?

218
00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.061
(Sabi) [Struggling] Oh

219
00:09:55.128 --> 00:09:56.467
- But Namkyung.
- (Namkyung) Huh?

220
00:09:56.534 --> 00:09:58.031
I saw it when I was dressing.

221
00:09:58.665 --> 00:10:01.234
It looks like it's only slightly open here.

222
00:10:01.301 --> 00:10:02.168
(Namkyung) Huh?

223
00:10:02.669 --> 00:10:03.901
Baby, no

224
00:10:03.968 --> 00:10:05.933
You're still dizzy so you saw it wrong.

225
00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:07.007
[Slaps his back]

226
00:10:09.167 --> 00:10:10.276
[light sigh]

227
00:10:10.343 --> 00:10:12.212
I'll attach the steri strip later.

228
00:10:12.712 --> 00:10:14.013
Right?

229
00:10:14.080 --> 00:10:15.333
Did you do something roughly?

230
00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:17.417
[Sound of door opening]
What do you really think of people?

231
00:10:17.484 --> 00:10:18.785
(Japanese) Sabisabi!

232
00:10:18.852 --> 00:10:19.753
Are you okay?

233
00:10:19.820 --> 00:10:22.500
Hey, did you snore a lot in the morning?

234
00:10:22.567 --> 00:10:23.667
Not me!

235
00:10:23.734 --> 00:10:25.391
Eom Jae-il, what about Enseid?

236
00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:26.359
Did you prescribe it?

237
00:10:26.426 --> 00:10:27.360
Oh, that's right

238
00:10:27.427 --> 00:10:28.294
[Sabi’s sigh]

239
00:10:28.361 --> 00:10:30.033
I'm really sick

240
00:10:30.100 --> 00:10:32.398
I took out the PCA and am feeling sick right now.

241
00:10:32.465 --> 00:10:34.100
Fish oil, fish oil, eomsal-eun

242
00:10:34.868 --> 00:10:35.835
Can you do it later?

243
00:10:35.902 --> 00:10:37.133
Okay, I'll do it.

244
00:10:37.200 --> 00:10:39.105
(Namkyung) I’ll call teacher Juyeon right now.

245
00:10:42.209 --> 00:10:43.676
- Did you change your phone?
- (Nanjing) Uh

246
00:10:44.936 --> 00:10:47.914
Clearing the past, new beginning, new phone

247
00:10:47.981 --> 00:10:49.249
Hey, Enseid first...

248
00:10:49.316 --> 00:10:51.818
(Jaeil) Hey, I guess this is for real this time?
I guess they really broke up

249
00:10:51.885 --> 00:10:53.386
(Namkyung) Oh, I completely organized it.

250
00:10:53.987 --> 00:10:56.522
Well, I deleted all the messages, numbers, and photos.

251
00:10:56.589 --> 00:10:58.258
[light music]
What was his cell phone number?

252
00:10:58.792 --> 00:10:59.793
Really...

253
00:11:00.434 --> 00:11:01.561
I don't even remember

254
00:11:01.628 --> 00:11:03.930
I didn't organize it

255
00:11:03.997 --> 00:11:05.132
Do you think you got hit?

256
00:11:05.199 --> 00:11:06.400
[Nankyung’s embarrassed laughter]

257
00:11:06.467 --> 00:11:08.667
(Japan) That’s usually
Don’t you say you were dumped?

258
00:11:08.734 --> 00:11:09.801
Ah, prescription first...

259
00:11:09.868 --> 00:11:10.837
(Namkyung) Hey, are you a high school student?

260
00:11:10.904 --> 00:11:13.567
Uh, who kicked the car?

261
00:11:13.634 --> 00:11:15.908
Just pretending to know things that you haven't even been in a relationship with

262
00:11:15.975 --> 00:11:17.644
Hey, that's enough, you guys go.

263
00:11:18.211 --> 00:11:19.066
Go, quickly

264
00:11:19.133 --> 00:11:20.456
(Nanjing) I still have to go

265
00:11:20.523 --> 00:11:22.792
Before you go, try this

266
00:11:23.267 --> 00:11:24.691
My lungs are also normal.

267
00:11:24.758 --> 00:11:26.426
At my age, I don’t have to do this.

268
00:11:27.054 --> 00:11:28.767
(Lee Young) Try it though, see if it’s okay

269
00:11:28.834 --> 00:11:30.023
Yeah, give it a try.

270
00:11:34.167 --> 00:11:35.128
(Japan) Oh

271
00:11:35.195 --> 00:11:37.267
My lungs came back fine, but what about my intestines?

272
00:11:37.334 --> 00:11:39.333
[Program operation sound effect]

273
00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:40.467
No gas?

274
00:11:40.534 --> 00:11:41.434
(Sabi) Uh

275
00:11:41.501 --> 00:11:43.036
So go

276
00:11:43.103 --> 00:11:44.304
please go

277
00:11:46.106 --> 00:11:47.141
[fart sound]

278
00:11:54.131 --> 00:11:55.213
[fart sound]

279
00:11:58.367 --> 00:11:59.285
gas out

280
00:11:59.352 --> 00:12:00.219
Confirmed

281
00:12:00.286 --> 00:12:01.500
Ah, it's smooth.

282
00:12:01.567 --> 00:12:02.656
[humorous music]

283
00:12:02.723 --> 00:12:04.024
(Nanjing) Going

284
00:12:04.091 --> 00:12:05.358
(Sabi) It’s not me

285
00:12:05.425 --> 00:12:06.792
Because it’s not me!
[Sound of door opening]

286
00:12:06.859 --> 00:12:08.161
[Jae-il and Lee Young’s heavy breathing]

287
00:12:08.228 --> 00:12:10.230
It's not me!
[Nanjing’s heavy sigh]

288
00:12:10.797 --> 00:12:13.534
(Jaeil) Hey, I decide the lunch menu.

289
00:12:13.601 --> 00:12:14.700
See you later

290
00:12:14.767 --> 00:12:16.836
[cell phone ringing sound]

291
00:12:19.039 --> 00:12:19.939
(Namkyung) Yes, professor.

292
00:12:21.074 --> 00:12:22.441
Oh, now?

293
00:12:22.508 --> 00:12:24.711
Oh, yes, yes, I'll put up balloons.

294
00:12:24.778 --> 00:12:25.813
yes

295
00:12:26.412 --> 00:12:27.233
[Call end sound]

296
00:12:27.300 --> 00:12:29.081
Hey, Professor Seo Jeong-min asked me to buy a cake.

297
00:12:29.148 --> 00:12:30.083
100 day party

298
00:12:31.485 --> 00:12:32.819
What kind of 100th day party are you having?

299
00:12:34.634 --> 00:12:36.489
Haha, annoying

300
00:12:37.291 --> 00:12:39.492
(Lee Young) Oh, why aren’t you coming? I have everything set up

301
00:12:39.559 --> 00:12:41.100
(Namkyung) Where did you set it up?

302
00:12:41.167 --> 00:12:42.495
Where are you?

303
00:12:42.562 --> 00:12:45.367
[Baby laughing sound effect]
I'm waiting in the NICU

304
00:12:45.434 --> 00:12:46.666
Are you saying you’re having a 100-day party?

305
00:12:46.733 --> 00:12:48.535
(Namkyung) Oh, it’s not there.

306
00:12:49.901 --> 00:12:50.837
then?

307
00:12:51.634 --> 00:12:52.705
(Lee Young) Child

308
00:13:00.747 --> 00:13:04.154
(Together) ♪ Happy birthday ♪

309
00:13:04.221 --> 00:13:05.667
[Exclamation and applause from medical staff]

310
00:13:05.734 --> 00:13:07.887
[Calm music]
- (Nanjing) Congratulations.
- (Minjoo) Congratulations.

311
00:13:10.157 --> 00:13:11.548
[Sound of Yeondu’s mouth blowing]

312
00:13:12.659 --> 00:13:13.918
[camera shutter sound]

313
00:13:16.930 --> 00:13:19.665
(Jeongmin) It’s already been 100 days since I was hospitalized.

314
00:13:19.732 --> 00:13:21.835
Have a hard time filling the douche.

315
00:13:21.902 --> 00:13:26.072
Ah, but
Is this something to be celebrated?

316
00:13:26.139 --> 00:13:27.506
(Jeongmin) That’s right

317
00:13:27.573 --> 00:13:30.276
The original pregnancy period was
It's a time to be celebrated all the time.

318
00:13:30.343 --> 00:13:34.414
Time to celebrate with family at home
Everything is being taken away from the hospital.

319
00:13:34.481 --> 00:13:35.948
We should celebrate too

320
00:13:36.015 --> 00:13:37.350
Tsk, is that so?

321
00:13:37.417 --> 00:13:38.651
[Embarrassed laughter]

322
00:13:38.718 --> 00:13:40.019
Oh, well
[takes a breath]

323
00:13:40.086 --> 00:13:43.190
for 100 days
To the high-risk mothers who come here

324
00:13:43.257 --> 00:13:46.292
There were a lot of good things and a lot of bad things

325
00:13:46.359 --> 00:13:49.829
(Yeondu) Write, I don’t have any big troubles
Because I endured it well.

326
00:13:49.896 --> 00:13:51.767
Wow, it's something to celebrate.

327
00:13:51.834 --> 00:13:53.300
[Yeondu and the medical staff laugh]

328
00:13:53.367 --> 00:13:54.601
thank you

329
00:13:55.368 --> 00:13:56.500
[Nurses’ light laughter]

330
00:13:56.567 --> 00:13:57.837
Did you make a wish?

331
00:13:57.904 --> 00:13:59.105
yes

332
00:13:59.172 --> 00:14:02.041
I will last 1,000 more days here

333
00:14:02.108 --> 00:14:05.211
I want my baby to come out healthy.

334
00:14:06.979 --> 00:14:09.682
Are you having a hard time getting along?

335
00:14:09.749 --> 00:14:11.484
(Jeongmin) There are a lot of uncomfortable things

336
00:14:11.551 --> 00:14:13.700
I was here the year before last when I was a twin.

337
00:14:13.767 --> 00:14:15.421
You lasted 80 days, right?

338
00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:18.675
So everything is familiar and comfortable.

339
00:14:18.742 --> 00:14:20.960
Hey, my twins

340
00:14:21.027 --> 00:14:21.895
[takes a breath]

341
00:14:21.962 --> 00:14:24.797
It's hard not to see mountains and fields.

342
00:14:25.365 --> 00:14:26.198
[Soft sigh]

343
00:14:26.265 --> 00:14:28.000
Just hold on for two more weeks

344
00:14:28.067 --> 00:14:30.303
113 days of partying

345
00:14:30.370 --> 00:14:32.901
No, let's have a baby party and go home.

346
00:14:32.968 --> 00:14:34.440
[laughter]

347
00:14:34.507 --> 00:14:35.700
yes

348
00:14:35.767 --> 00:14:39.445
Ah, this cake
Shall we share it with the mothers here?

349
00:14:41.481 --> 00:14:42.734
(Jeongmin) Let’s just eat by ourselves.

350
00:14:42.801 --> 00:14:43.750
(Nanjing) By ourselves?

351
00:14:43.817 --> 00:14:45.652
It's been a while since everyone came in

352
00:14:46.753 --> 00:14:48.006
It hasn't opened yet

353
00:14:52.067 --> 00:14:53.960
(Namkyung) Ah...
[cell phone ringing sound]

354
00:14:57.463 --> 00:14:59.667
Uh, mountains, fields

355
00:14:59.734 --> 00:15:01.168
(together) mom

356
00:15:01.235 --> 00:15:02.400
did you sleep well?

357
00:15:02.467 --> 00:15:03.367
(Yeondu) What about rice?

358
00:15:03.434 --> 00:15:05.400
- We ate snacks (together)
- (Yeondu) Huh?

359
00:15:05.467 --> 00:15:07.567
What if I eat snacks in the morning?

360
00:15:07.634 --> 00:15:08.841
[Yeondu’s laughter]

361
00:15:09.610 --> 00:15:11.066
(Sani) Where are you, mom?

362
00:15:11.133 --> 00:15:12.033
(Yeondu) Teachers

363
00:15:12.100 --> 00:15:13.400
(together) Hello teacher

364
00:15:13.467 --> 00:15:14.914
[Jeongmin and Namgyeong’s laughter]

365
00:15:15.815 --> 00:15:18.051
(Japan) Wow! It's here, it's here!

366
00:15:18.118 --> 00:15:20.086
- Delicious tteokbokki has arrived!
- (Lee Young) I came, I came, I came

367
00:15:20.153 --> 00:15:21.921
(Namkyung) Wow! looks delicious!

368
00:15:21.988 --> 00:15:24.724
Ah, why did you come so late?
I'm really starving to death

369
00:15:24.791 --> 00:15:25.634
(Jae-il) Wow!

370
00:15:25.701 --> 00:15:27.200
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

371
00:15:27.267 --> 00:15:28.261
Wow, that sounds delicious.

372
00:15:29.897 --> 00:15:31.864
(Nanjing) Two, two?
[Jaeil’s sniffing sound]

373
00:15:31.931 --> 00:15:33.300
Wow, this is it

374
00:15:33.367 --> 00:15:35.801
(Lee Young) Wow, I just ate cake.
The smell was crazy

375
00:15:35.868 --> 00:15:38.405
Hey, because I ate cake.
Don’t you want to eat more tteokbokki?

376
00:15:38.472 --> 00:15:39.905
A slightly sweet and salty feeling

377
00:15:39.972 --> 00:15:42.592
Ah, but I feel sorry for Sabi.

378
00:15:42.659 --> 00:15:43.976
This is his favorite

379
00:15:44.043 --> 00:15:45.077
(Lee Young) What do you think? I can eat it again.

380
00:15:45.144 --> 00:15:46.312
Yeah, yeah

381
00:15:47.147 --> 00:15:48.114
[upbeat music]
(Namkyung) Yo, Eom Jae-il!

382
00:15:48.181 --> 00:15:49.548
You didn't miss any toppings, right?

383
00:15:49.615 --> 00:15:50.467
of course!

384
00:15:50.534 --> 00:15:51.584
As Sabi said

385
00:15:51.651 --> 00:15:52.918
- Add cheese
- (together) Hey!

386
00:15:52.985 --> 00:15:54.500
- (Japan) Added sausage!
- (together) Hey!

387
00:15:54.567 --> 00:15:56.422
- (Jae-il) And!
- (Sabi) Add vermicelli!
[Music cuts out]

388
00:15:59.901 --> 00:16:01.901
[Majestic music]

389
00:16:16.008 --> 00:16:18.177
When I am discharged from hospital
Didn’t you say we would eat together?

390
00:16:20.280 --> 00:16:21.281
[Nanjing’s satisfying elasticity]

391
00:16:23.643 --> 00:16:24.850
no

392
00:16:24.917 --> 00:16:26.808
Put the fish cake on rice balls and eat it.

393
00:16:29.637 --> 00:16:30.526
That's right

394
00:16:31.191 --> 00:16:34.518
Wrap cheese with rice cake and add sausage

395
00:16:37.431 --> 00:16:40.066
[Nanjing’s satisfying elasticity]
[sound of hitting]

396
00:16:40.133 --> 00:16:41.500
(Nanjing) It’s so delicious!

397
00:16:41.567 --> 00:16:43.133
[Nankyung’s satisfied moans]

398
00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:44.671
Can you walk around like this?

399
00:16:44.738 --> 00:16:46.834
(Sabi) I’m bored to death, what should I do?

400
00:16:46.901 --> 00:16:48.007
Bored?

401
00:16:48.608 --> 00:16:50.377
Sir, I’m jealous.

402
00:16:50.444 --> 00:16:52.167
I slept so much I couldn't sleep

403
00:16:52.234 --> 00:16:54.914
(Jaeil) Hey, have you had surgery?
It's been a day, one day

404
00:16:54.981 --> 00:16:55.849
But Lee Young-ah

405
00:16:55.916 --> 00:16:57.616
Has it been 100 days since Jiyeondu's mother was hospitalized?

406
00:16:57.683 --> 00:16:58.534
(Lee Young) How do you know that?

407
00:16:58.601 --> 00:17:00.420
I was bored so I looked at the mothers' charts.

408
00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:03.467
(Sabi) Today is 32 weeks and 1 day.

409
00:17:03.534 --> 00:17:05.867
Counting backwards, it's exactly 100 days from the day of hospitalization.

410
00:17:05.934 --> 00:17:07.493
So you had a party during the day earlier.

411
00:17:07.560 --> 00:17:08.634
(Sabi) Ah

412
00:17:08.701 --> 00:17:10.629
Is the maternal cervix maintained well?

413
00:17:10.696 --> 00:17:13.032
(Lee Young) Yes, I’m holding on well while taking the medicine.

414
00:17:13.099 --> 00:17:14.300
What about EBW?

415
00:17:14.367 --> 00:17:15.334
Hit by a douche

416
00:17:16.235 --> 00:17:18.637
When I checked Sono yesterday, it was 1,900g.

417
00:17:18.704 --> 00:17:19.705
Is the amount of amniotic fluid okay?

418
00:17:19.772 --> 00:17:21.340
(Lee Young) Yes, I checked it earlier.

419
00:17:23.243 --> 00:17:25.567
Hey, if you're going to do this, go check it out.
I'll go and lie down

420
00:17:25.634 --> 00:17:26.933
(Namkyung) Yes, just do it, you

421
00:17:27.000 --> 00:17:28.381
I want to do that too

422
00:17:28.948 --> 00:17:29.782
Hey!

423
00:17:29.849 --> 00:17:31.717
(Sabi) You have to soak the rice balls in the soup!

424
00:17:32.385 --> 00:17:33.300
[lively music]

425
00:17:33.367 --> 00:17:35.187
If you're going to be that angry, just eat it.

426
00:17:35.722 --> 00:17:36.989
I will give up my personality

427
00:17:37.824 --> 00:17:39.234
Then just one

428
00:17:39.301 --> 00:17:40.861
No, you eat this.

429
00:17:40.928 --> 00:17:41.861
(Residence in Japan) Hmm

430
00:17:51.767 --> 00:17:53.005
- (Jeongmin) Mother
- (Seol-ah) Yes

431
00:17:53.072 --> 00:17:54.841
(Jeongmin) Have you been doing this the whole time?

432
00:17:56.121 --> 00:17:56.867
[Seol-ah’s labored breathing]

433
00:17:56.934 --> 00:17:59.678
Since you've been lying on your left side for several days

434
00:17:59.745 --> 00:18:01.634
Of course my arms are numb.

435
00:18:01.701 --> 00:18:03.783
(Lee Young) I told you to lie down right away.

436
00:18:04.267 --> 00:18:06.185
The mother said she didn't like it

437
00:18:06.753 --> 00:18:08.220
Oh, while pregnant

438
00:18:08.287 --> 00:18:09.489
If you lie down straight

439
00:18:09.556 --> 00:18:12.024
I heard that some people faint due to low blood pressure.

440
00:18:12.525 --> 00:18:15.194
No, I asked if that was true.
He said he didn't know

441
00:18:19.837 --> 00:18:21.236
in the second half of pregnancy

442
00:18:21.869 --> 00:18:24.434
The uterus is large and heavy.

443
00:18:24.501 --> 00:18:28.874
When you lie down, it puts pressure on the surrounding blood vessels.
That could happen.

444
00:18:28.941 --> 00:18:31.100
In that case, lie down on your left side.
It's helpful

445
00:18:31.167 --> 00:18:32.200
(Seol-ah) Ah...

446
00:18:32.267 --> 00:18:33.646
(Lee Young) Ah

447
00:18:34.647 --> 00:18:36.582
(Jeongmin) I think that’s why those words came out.

448
00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:38.484
Right?

449
00:18:38.551 --> 00:18:39.519
Teacher Oh I-young?

450
00:18:40.787 --> 00:18:42.166
yes

451
00:18:42.233 --> 00:18:45.100
The mother is still
There is no need to worry about that.

452
00:18:45.167 --> 00:18:46.259
Really?

453
00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:48.727
Can I really lie down straight?

454
00:18:48.794 --> 00:18:49.700
yes

455
00:18:49.767 --> 00:18:51.931
If necessary, let me lie on my left side.

456
00:18:51.998 --> 00:18:53.333
I'll tell you

457
00:18:53.400 --> 00:18:54.534
(Seol-ah) Ah...

458
00:18:55.869 --> 00:18:56.871
(Yeondu) Ah ugh

459
00:18:57.538 --> 00:18:59.543
I think you saw the same blog as me.

460
00:19:00.807 --> 00:19:01.948
Twins, right?

461
00:19:02.567 --> 00:19:04.933
Looking at my stomach, 24 weeks?

462
00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:06.111
Um, yes

463
00:19:06.178 --> 00:19:09.700
(Yeondu) Sseu-eup, twins, 24 weeks, left fainting

464
00:19:09.767 --> 00:19:11.200
If you search on the internet

465
00:19:11.267 --> 00:19:12.351
the text at the top

466
00:19:12.418 --> 00:19:14.454
Is it that hot mom? That meow mom?

467
00:19:14.521 --> 00:19:15.989
Oh, that's right, that hot mom.

468
00:19:16.056 --> 00:19:17.523
No, I saw that the year before last too.

469
00:19:17.590 --> 00:19:20.026
Lying on my left side all day and night

470
00:19:20.093 --> 00:19:21.834
I thought you were going to cut off your arm.
[lively music]

471
00:19:21.901 --> 00:19:23.066
[Yeondu’s light smile]

472
00:19:23.133 --> 00:19:26.065
(Yeondu) No, the professor
You said the same thing to me too

473
00:19:26.132 --> 00:19:29.734
I lay down right after that and everything was fine.

474
00:19:29.801 --> 00:19:31.600
I said this

475
00:19:31.667 --> 00:19:33.505
I wondered where I heard it

476
00:19:33.572 --> 00:19:34.333
[Embarrassed laughter]

477
00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.708
(Jeongmin) Those twins

478
00:19:35.775 --> 00:19:37.834
Grows well in the womb for up to 35 weeks

479
00:19:37.901 --> 00:19:40.447
I weighed 2.9 kg and was healthy.

480
00:19:40.514 --> 00:19:41.647
Really?

481
00:19:47.287 --> 00:19:48.167
[Seol-ah’s groans of exertion]

482
00:19:48.234 --> 00:19:50.022
[Seol-ah moans in pain]

483
00:19:50.089 --> 00:19:51.857
(Seol-ah) Hey, it’s my arm.

484
00:19:51.924 --> 00:19:53.033
[Seol-ah’s painful exclamation]

485
00:19:53.100 --> 00:19:53.927
[Jeongmin sighs]

486
00:19:53.994 --> 00:19:55.328
Are you feeling a bit sad?

487
00:19:56.262 --> 00:19:58.764
More than us, the mother of Yeondu said
I think I believe it more

488
00:19:58.831 --> 00:20:00.532
(Seol-ah) Oh, no.

489
00:20:00.599 --> 00:20:02.500
No, it's not like that.

490
00:20:02.567 --> 00:20:05.233
No, you've been there for a long time.

491
00:20:05.300 --> 00:20:06.739
I have some faith.

492
00:20:06.806 --> 00:20:09.409
If you don’t know something, feel free to ask.

493
00:20:09.476 --> 00:20:12.079
I'm a high-risk expert.

494
00:20:12.946 --> 00:20:14.467
[Seol-ah’s light smile]

495
00:20:14.534 --> 00:20:16.048
[Seol-ah’s painful breathing]

496
00:20:16.115 --> 00:20:17.843
Let's find out

497
00:20:17.910 --> 00:20:19.818
I'm not even going to ask the professor.

498
00:20:19.885 --> 00:20:20.987
I don't know?

499
00:20:21.655 --> 00:20:23.389
Is that something that will come out of the major's mouth?

500
00:20:23.934 --> 00:20:25.167
sorry

501
00:20:25.234 --> 00:20:26.200
(Jeongmin) Oh Iyoung

502
00:20:26.267 --> 00:20:28.394
You're saying that because you're not scared of me anymore, right?

503
00:20:28.461 --> 00:20:29.361
yes?

504
00:20:29.428 --> 00:20:31.665
no, it's scary

505
00:20:31.732 --> 00:20:33.063
(Lee Young) The professor is scary too.

506
00:20:33.699 --> 00:20:35.601
I did it because I was more scared of my ignorance.

507
00:20:36.268 --> 00:20:39.305
Oh, our resident was scared of that?

508
00:20:40.172 --> 00:20:41.741
Then I have to solve it.

509
00:20:43.142 --> 00:20:43.977
Yes?

510
00:20:44.044 --> 00:20:45.300
Every day from today

511
00:20:45.367 --> 00:20:47.200
Study Williams one chapter at a time.

512
00:20:47.267 --> 00:20:49.281
(Jeongmin) Summarize the contents and send me an email.
[light music]

513
00:20:49.348 --> 00:20:51.217
After seeing that, I will ask questions every day.

514
00:20:51.952 --> 00:20:53.385
If you answer like that

515
00:20:53.452 --> 00:20:54.867
All the scary things will go away?

516
00:20:54.934 --> 00:20:56.634
Ah, professor...

517
00:20:56.701 --> 00:20:57.757
(Jeongmin) Why!

518
00:20:58.361 --> 00:20:59.352
Starting today

519
00:20:59.927 --> 00:21:01.153
Only a few hours left

520
00:21:05.264 --> 00:21:06.133
[Sound of hitting desk]

521
00:21:06.200 --> 00:21:07.633
[Lee Young’s exasperated exclamation]

522
00:21:09.934 --> 00:21:11.303
(Yeondu) Me, teacher

523
00:21:16.510 --> 00:21:17.552
[Yeondu’s sigh]

524
00:21:19.044 --> 00:21:20.946
Oh, there

525
00:21:21.748 --> 00:21:23.783
On ultrasound in the morning

526
00:21:24.451 --> 00:21:28.120
I was wondering if my cervix length was okay.

527
00:21:28.187 --> 00:21:29.254
Ah!

528
00:21:29.321 --> 00:21:30.656
What I'm saying is

529
00:21:36.830 --> 00:21:38.360
Sorry, mom.

530
00:21:38.866 --> 00:21:41.667
Measured 3 days ago
It's maintained just as well.

531
00:21:42.401 --> 00:21:43.817
(Yeondu) Ah...

532
00:21:43.884 --> 00:21:45.100
yes

533
00:21:45.167 --> 00:21:46.906
Umbilical cord blood flow is also OK.

534
00:21:47.439 --> 00:21:48.874
But teacher

535
00:21:50.043 --> 00:21:51.552
Too close...

536
00:21:52.946 --> 00:21:53.958
(Lee Young) Ah!

537
00:21:54.467 --> 00:21:55.448
sorry

538
00:21:56.133 --> 00:21:58.200
I think the professor does this.

539
00:21:58.267 --> 00:21:59.685
[Exciting laughter]

540
00:21:59.752 --> 00:22:02.734
Hey, just bend your knees slightly.

541
00:22:02.801 --> 00:22:04.066
[Baby laughing sound effect]

542
00:22:04.133 --> 00:22:05.056
(Lee Young) Ah!

543
00:22:05.123 --> 00:22:06.333
Ah...
[humorous music]

544
00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:08.327
[Embarrassed laughter]
[Yeondu’s light smile]

545
00:22:08.394 --> 00:22:10.996
(Yeondu) No, we
It's hard to sit down

546
00:22:11.063 --> 00:22:13.133
I'm almost lying down.

547
00:22:13.200 --> 00:22:15.367
So, I want to keep you at eye level.

548
00:22:15.434 --> 00:22:16.635
(Lee Young) Ah, yes

549
00:22:17.503 --> 00:22:20.273
Ultrasound is okay, don't worry.

550
00:22:20.340 --> 00:22:21.467
[light laughter]

551
00:22:21.534 --> 00:22:22.608
Thank you

552
00:22:29.000 --> 00:22:30.683
(Dongho) I know you’re tired.

553
00:22:31.684 --> 00:22:34.119
The reason I don’t even reply to messages sent during the day is because
Is that a bit too much?

554
00:22:34.186 --> 00:22:35.020
[Lee Young’s surprised gasp]

555
00:22:35.087 --> 00:22:36.522
(Lee Young) Oh, that’s right, I’m sorry.

556
00:22:36.589 --> 00:22:38.056
I was so busy today

557
00:22:38.123 --> 00:22:39.992
I sent you a message asking if you were free this evening.

558
00:22:40.059 --> 00:22:41.627
I'm on duty today

559
00:22:42.228 --> 00:22:43.167
[sigh]

560
00:22:43.234 --> 00:22:45.300
our 3rd week
You know you're just setting the time, right?

561
00:22:45.367 --> 00:22:47.032
- (Lee Young) Has it already happened like that?
- (Dongho) Yes

562
00:22:47.901 --> 00:22:49.735
So how about this Friday?

563
00:22:49.802 --> 00:22:51.570
(Lee Young) Friday is...

564
00:22:52.638 --> 00:22:54.700
No duty, no appointments.

565
00:22:54.767 --> 00:22:56.208
Really? Will it happen that day?

566
00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:00.614
- (Lee Young) Yes
- (Dongho) Okay
[Soft music]

567
00:23:00.681 --> 00:23:02.148
Then 3 days later on Friday

568
00:23:02.634 --> 00:23:03.734
yes, what

569
00:23:03.801 --> 00:23:04.834
What do you want to eat?

570
00:23:04.901 --> 00:23:06.100
What is your favorite food?

571
00:23:06.167 --> 00:23:08.233
I like everything

572
00:23:08.300 --> 00:23:09.922
[Elevator arrival sound]
(Dongho) Me too

573
00:23:09.989 --> 00:23:11.190
It’s convenient near the hospital, right?

574
00:23:13.701 --> 00:23:14.760
(together) hello

575
00:23:15.729 --> 00:23:16.757
hello

576
00:23:17.763 --> 00:23:19.434
Teacher Ham Dong-ho, what are you doing here?

577
00:23:19.501 --> 00:23:21.033
Oh, there's a painless call.

578
00:23:21.935 --> 00:23:22.936
(Dowon) Ah...

579
00:23:27.501 --> 00:23:28.407
Not riding?

580
00:23:28.474 --> 00:23:29.367
ah!

581
00:23:29.434 --> 00:23:30.876
(Dongho) Oh, we have some left to talk about.

582
00:23:32.045 --> 00:23:33.156
Go up first

583
00:23:34.982 --> 00:23:36.462
I'll go up soon

584
00:23:37.651 --> 00:23:38.634
yes

585
00:23:40.787 --> 00:23:42.788
I’ll make a reservation at a good place nearby (Dongho).

586
00:23:43.624 --> 00:23:44.590
(Do-won) Oh I-young

587
00:23:48.262 --> 00:23:49.962
[Calm music]

588
00:23:54.268 --> 00:23:55.234
No, see you later.

589
00:23:55.936 --> 00:23:56.936
Good job

590
00:24:10.918 --> 00:24:13.086
[bird chirping]

591
00:24:13.153 --> 00:24:14.819
[Lips smacking sound]

592
00:24:17.534 --> 00:24:18.825
[Lee Young makes a yuck sound]

593
00:24:18.892 --> 00:24:20.492
Oh, isn't it?

594
00:24:26.408 --> 00:24:27.499
(Lee Young) Write...

595
00:24:34.775 --> 00:24:35.708
[Clears cough]

596
00:24:36.777 --> 00:24:39.712
Hey, I have a question.

597
00:24:40.781 --> 00:24:41.882
Are you talking about my friend?

598
00:24:41.949 --> 00:24:42.915
[Laughs]

599
00:24:44.051 --> 00:24:45.050
Friends?

600
00:24:47.586 --> 00:24:48.353
sorry

601
00:24:48.420 --> 00:24:50.207
Yes, I have a friend who works at work.

602
00:24:50.274 --> 00:24:51.341
Let’s say there is (Japanese)

603
00:24:51.408 --> 00:24:52.873
Why? Where does it hurt?

604
00:24:52.940 --> 00:24:54.140
no

605
00:24:54.207 --> 00:24:56.395
Someone keeps asking me to eat together

606
00:24:57.698 --> 00:24:59.064
major surgery, no

607
00:24:59.565 --> 00:25:01.568
I did a big project

608
00:25:01.635 --> 00:25:03.341
Did you help me a lot or something?

609
00:25:03.408 --> 00:25:04.901
- I guess you're grateful.
- (Jaeil) I like it.

610
00:25:04.968 --> 00:25:06.506
[light music]

611
00:25:06.573 --> 00:25:08.473
(Lee Young) But there’s someone she likes

612
00:25:08.540 --> 00:25:10.940
Then, shall we eat together?

613
00:25:11.007 --> 00:25:11.873
eat

614
00:25:11.940 --> 00:25:12.845
(Jaeil) Don’t eat it

615
00:25:14.214 --> 00:25:16.749
Asking for a meal is asking for a date.

616
00:25:17.583 --> 00:25:19.284
(Namkyung) What kind of date are you asking for?

617
00:25:19.351 --> 00:25:20.320
Just, huh?

618
00:25:20.387 --> 00:25:22.989
We went through a hard time together, so let’s eat together.

619
00:25:23.056 --> 00:25:24.790
Can’t you even eat with your colleagues?

620
00:25:26.041 --> 00:25:27.039
(Lee Young) Then do you eat?

621
00:25:27.106 --> 00:25:28.395
no

622
00:25:28.462 --> 00:25:29.962
-Are you telling me to eat it?
- (Nanjing) Uh

623
00:25:30.497 --> 00:25:31.665
I overdid it for no reason

624
00:25:31.732 --> 00:25:33.867
I said no because there is someone I like.

625
00:25:33.934 --> 00:25:35.640
You kick the blanket alone at night

626
00:25:35.707 --> 00:25:37.140
Just go and eat

627
00:25:37.207 --> 00:25:38.540
Well, maybe that person

628
00:25:38.607 --> 00:25:41.108
If you say you like it, you can say it then.

629
00:25:41.175 --> 00:25:42.474
There is someone I like

630
00:25:43.443 --> 00:25:44.907
Yeah?
[Nanjing’s sigh]

631
00:25:44.974 --> 00:25:47.881
It's because everyone watches too many dramas.

632
00:25:47.948 --> 00:25:50.144
(Namkyung) Someone likes us more than we thought

633
00:25:50.211 --> 00:25:53.066
Confessing your unrequited love and things like that

634
00:25:53.133 --> 00:25:54.538
It's not that easy

635
00:25:54.605 --> 00:25:55.954
It's very difficult

636
00:25:56.021 --> 00:25:58.200
[Sprays dull mist]

637
00:25:58.267 --> 00:26:00.893
Ah, why didn’t you do it again?

638
00:26:00.960 --> 00:26:03.262
Are you going on a blind date at 6 in the morning?

639
00:26:04.097 --> 00:26:06.598
(Jae-il) That’s not true
Just because someone buys me food
[Closes the bag zipper]

640
00:26:07.134 --> 00:26:08.133
(Nanjing) Who?

641
00:26:10.204 --> 00:26:11.132
first love

642
00:26:12.906 --> 00:26:13.840
(Nanjing) Today?

643
00:26:13.907 --> 00:26:15.307
- suddenly?
- (Lee Young) Where?

644
00:26:16.610 --> 00:26:17.646
(together) Who is it?

645
00:26:17.713 --> 00:26:19.178
(Japan) I was a tutor when I was in high school.

646
00:26:19.707 --> 00:26:20.813
I really liked it

647
00:26:21.707 --> 00:26:23.473
I went to medical school following that teacher.

648
00:26:23.540 --> 00:26:24.416
Are you a doctor?

649
00:26:25.262 --> 00:26:26.296
Someone from our hospital?

650
00:26:26.363 --> 00:26:27.342
no

651
00:26:27.888 --> 00:26:30.690
That would have been really nice

652
00:26:30.757 --> 00:26:32.259
(Jaeil) Did I confess back then?

653
00:26:32.326 --> 00:26:34.773
But when I go to college, I become someone like myself.
It's widespread and widespread

654
00:26:34.840 --> 00:26:36.606
I told you to study hard

655
00:26:36.673 --> 00:26:37.730
There is no such person

656
00:26:38.799 --> 00:26:40.233
What kind of person are you?

657
00:26:40.300 --> 00:26:41.266
(Jay) Um...

658
00:26:43.403 --> 00:26:44.470
A huge person?

659
00:26:45.472 --> 00:26:47.839
[Soft music]
The way you speak and the look on your face

660
00:26:47.906 --> 00:26:49.675
He's very cold and blunt.

661
00:26:50.677 --> 00:26:52.148
When you smile, you're so bright

662
00:26:52.746 --> 00:26:54.314
And my favorite thing in the world

663
00:26:54.381 --> 00:26:56.650
Studying and spicy tteokbokki

664
00:26:56.717 --> 00:26:58.107
[laughter]

665
00:26:58.174 --> 00:26:59.251
Isn't it very cute?

666
00:26:59.853 --> 00:27:00.753
(Namkyung) Huh?

667
00:27:02.656 --> 00:27:04.974
I saw someone like that

668
00:27:05.041 --> 00:27:05.924
me too

669
00:27:07.961 --> 00:27:09.429
That's Sabi Kim

670
00:27:09.496 --> 00:27:10.729
(Nanjing) Uh

671
00:27:10.796 --> 00:27:11.997
- Hey!
- (Sabi) Hey!

672
00:27:12.064 --> 00:27:14.134
[Interesting music]
Aren’t you guys going quickly?

673
00:27:14.201 --> 00:27:16.235
When are you going to hand over and when are you going to do the free rounds?

674
00:27:16.974 --> 00:27:17.904
Hey

675
00:27:17.971 --> 00:27:19.207
To whom

676
00:27:19.274 --> 00:27:20.606
Because it’s on a different level from him?

677
00:27:23.710 --> 00:27:25.244
(Jaeil) You’re talking nonsense.

678
00:27:28.041 --> 00:27:28.974
(Sabi) Why are you like that?

679
00:27:29.041 --> 00:27:30.250
Where is he going?

680
00:27:30.317 --> 00:27:31.977
[cell phone ringing sound]
To meet my first love

681
00:27:33.820 --> 00:27:34.753
(Nanjing) Uh

682
00:27:35.322 --> 00:27:36.303
Hospital?

683
00:27:36.990 --> 00:27:39.040
Oh, well, what are you doing?

684
00:27:39.107 --> 00:27:40.592
Oh, wait, wait a minute.

685
00:27:41.161 --> 00:27:42.094
uh

686
00:27:42.618 --> 00:27:43.463
(Lee Young) What is it?

687
00:27:43.530 --> 00:27:44.518
(Sabi) Mr. Hong Ki-dong?

688
00:27:48.836 --> 00:27:49.830
line...

689
00:27:51.807 --> 00:27:52.704
older sister

690
00:27:53.607 --> 00:27:55.674
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

691
00:28:09.708 --> 00:28:10.923
(Jae-il) What are you doing here?

692
00:28:10.990 --> 00:28:13.126
Did you come here on purpose to eat with me?

693
00:28:13.193 --> 00:28:14.529
[Bewildered] No

694
00:28:15.762 --> 00:28:18.530
Because of the mid-term presentation of the Ph.D.
I came to see the professor

695
00:28:19.202 --> 00:28:20.040
(Jay) Ah...

696
00:28:20.107 --> 00:28:22.055
(Winter) It came a little early too.

697
00:28:22.122 --> 00:28:24.461
Because I always remember you asking me to see you

698
00:28:24.528 --> 00:28:26.613
Oh, so you did think about me, though?

699
00:28:26.680 --> 00:28:29.608
Yeah, I just said I'd see you, but I didn't see you all the time.

700
00:28:30.544 --> 00:28:31.378
yes

701
00:28:31.445 --> 00:28:32.405
(Winter) How have you been?

702
00:28:33.347 --> 00:28:34.546
Is it worth it to become a major?

703
00:28:35.147 --> 00:28:36.007
Is it hard?

704
00:28:36.074 --> 00:28:37.850
Yes, it's really hard.

705
00:28:38.385 --> 00:28:40.052
How can I do this for four years, sister?

706
00:28:41.522 --> 00:28:42.560
teacher

707
00:28:43.557 --> 00:28:47.010
Not my sister, but my teacher

708
00:28:47.077 --> 00:28:48.096
[lively music]

709
00:28:48.163 --> 00:28:50.564
yes, teacher

710
00:28:50.631 --> 00:28:51.997
[Winter laughs]

711
00:28:52.633 --> 00:28:55.473
My grades fell
It seems like just yesterday I was whining

712
00:28:55.540 --> 00:28:57.871
(Winter) I saw you wearing a gown
It's fascinating

713
00:28:57.938 --> 00:28:59.104
[Jaeil’s light smile]

714
00:28:59.832 --> 00:29:01.241
It's all thanks to the teacher

715
00:29:01.308 --> 00:29:02.540
(Japan) Hiboyz disbanded

716
00:29:02.607 --> 00:29:04.977
I studied with a teacher for just 2 years
You went to medical school, right?

717
00:29:05.546 --> 00:29:06.680
If it weren't for the teacher

718
00:29:06.747 --> 00:29:07.880
I wouldn't have been a doctor

719
00:29:09.383 --> 00:29:10.257
me too

720
00:29:11.874 --> 00:29:13.473
If it weren't for your tutoring fee

721
00:29:13.540 --> 00:29:15.053
I probably wouldn't have graduated from school

722
00:29:15.622 --> 00:29:16.588
[Makes a yuck sound]

723
00:29:17.791 --> 00:29:18.790
[sigh]

724
00:29:20.394 --> 00:29:21.326
(Residence in Japan) But

725
00:29:23.197 --> 00:29:25.097
My first love was a teacher

726
00:29:25.707 --> 00:29:26.960
Do you remember?

727
00:29:27.027 --> 00:29:27.928
Did you?

728
00:29:27.995 --> 00:29:29.488
I don't know, I don't remember

729
00:29:30.170 --> 00:29:31.438
(Winter) When was that?

730
00:29:31.505 --> 00:29:32.804
It must have been more than 10 years

731
00:29:35.008 --> 00:29:35.909
Why don't you eat it?

732
00:29:35.976 --> 00:29:37.309
You always ask me to buy you food?

733
00:29:41.522 --> 00:29:43.081
I didn't ask you to buy me something like this.

734
00:29:44.785 --> 00:29:46.084
(Jaeil) Please buy it again next time

735
00:29:46.687 --> 00:29:49.154
Wear plain clothes, not these clothes

736
00:29:49.790 --> 00:29:51.827
[Interesting music]

737
00:29:56.683 --> 00:29:57.663
Well...

738
00:29:58.365 --> 00:30:00.434
Then change your clothes and come back to eat.

739
00:30:00.501 --> 00:30:01.900
Are you doing this on purpose?

740
00:30:02.870 --> 00:30:03.637
Right?

741
00:30:03.704 --> 00:30:05.671
(Winter) Oh, did you notice it?

742
00:30:06.840 --> 00:30:08.291
I have a good poker face.

743
00:30:08.358 --> 00:30:09.201
[Jaeil’s sigh]

744
00:30:09.268 --> 00:30:10.909
[cell phone ringing sound]

745
00:30:16.149 --> 00:30:17.108
Wait a minute

746
00:30:18.974 --> 00:30:20.018
(Winter) Oh

747
00:30:20.916 --> 00:30:21.887
Not yet

748
00:30:22.523 --> 00:30:24.189
To meet someone for a moment

749
00:30:25.174 --> 00:30:27.092
I have surgery today at 4 o'clock, so it's okay.

750
00:30:27.561 --> 00:30:28.462
[shy laughter]

751
00:30:28.529 --> 00:30:29.828
I'll be there as soon as possible

752
00:30:30.797 --> 00:30:31.754
yes

753
00:30:33.374 --> 00:30:34.267
[Call end tone]

754
00:30:34.334 --> 00:30:35.702
Do you have to go?

755
00:30:35.769 --> 00:30:36.536
(winter) no

756
00:30:36.603 --> 00:30:37.907
Didn’t something happen at the hospital?

757
00:30:37.974 --> 00:30:39.966
It's not a hospital, boyfriend.

758
00:30:40.033 --> 00:30:42.107
[tragic music]
(Winter) We decided to have lunch together later.

759
00:30:42.174 --> 00:30:43.307
When are you coming?

760
00:30:43.374 --> 00:30:44.276
Ah...

761
00:30:44.845 --> 00:30:46.807
Who is your boyfriend?

762
00:30:46.874 --> 00:30:48.115
Someone you don't know?

763
00:30:48.182 --> 00:30:49.348
Since when did you meet?

764
00:30:50.062 --> 00:30:51.184
It's been a while

765
00:30:51.251 --> 00:30:52.540
No...

766
00:30:52.607 --> 00:30:53.940
Why are you saying that now?

767
00:30:54.007 --> 00:30:56.490
Why should I tell you that?

768
00:30:56.557 --> 00:30:57.689
(Residence in Japan) Ha, Mr...

769
00:30:58.241 --> 00:30:59.191
Then why...

770
00:31:00.727 --> 00:31:02.696
Why are you buying me food?

771
00:31:02.763 --> 00:31:03.962
[absurd laughter]

772
00:31:06.041 --> 00:31:06.932
bread

773
00:31:07.974 --> 00:31:09.301
(Winter) I bought you bread

774
00:31:09.770 --> 00:31:11.136
[light music]
Mistress

775
00:31:12.372 --> 00:31:13.372
[laughter]

776
00:31:14.708 --> 00:31:15.674
(Winter) Ugh

777
00:31:16.276 --> 00:31:17.676
When will you grow up?

778
00:31:18.240 --> 00:31:19.240
[light laughter]

779
00:31:19.307 --> 00:31:20.212
[laughter]

780
00:31:32.060 --> 00:31:33.625
(Sabi) What was your first love? Did you meet well?

781
00:31:34.328 --> 00:31:37.158
(Jaeil) Oh, I had a good time.

782
00:31:37.225 --> 00:31:38.063
(Sabi) Why did you come?

783
00:31:38.732 --> 00:31:39.798
(Residence in Japan) Doctoral degree...

784
00:31:40.907 --> 00:31:41.740
Hey

785
00:31:42.241 --> 00:31:43.773
You go and get some rest, please.

786
00:31:43.840 --> 00:31:45.138
Doesn’t it hurt?

787
00:31:45.205 --> 00:31:47.039
(Sabi) It hurts, it still hurts

788
00:31:51.807 --> 00:31:53.578
(Jay) I’m sick
Why are you looking for work?

789
00:31:54.414 --> 00:31:56.348
(Sabi) I can’t rest anymore

790
00:31:58.202 --> 00:31:59.251
(Jaeil) Okay, work.

791
00:31:59.720 --> 00:32:00.819
I do work

792
00:32:01.588 --> 00:32:04.057
Please tell the patients
Don't tell me the surgery hurts

793
00:32:04.124 --> 00:32:05.357
Everyone is scared

794
00:32:05.959 --> 00:32:07.259
(Sabi) It’s true, but what should I do?

795
00:32:07.807 --> 00:32:08.895
I can't lie

796
00:32:08.962 --> 00:32:09.950
[Jaeil’s sigh]

797
00:32:10.898 --> 00:32:12.899
When I tried it, our explanations were all wrong.

798
00:32:12.966 --> 00:32:14.334
Who says laparoscopy doesn’t hurt?

799
00:32:14.401 --> 00:32:15.535
It hurts forever

800
00:32:15.602 --> 00:32:17.137
And what is simple?

801
00:32:17.204 --> 00:32:19.606
Surgery, anesthesia, hospitalization, everything?

802
00:32:19.673 --> 00:32:20.640
and you

803
00:32:20.707 --> 00:32:22.640
Don't peck at us because you can't urinate.

804
00:32:22.707 --> 00:32:24.076
We don’t want to do Nellathon either.

805
00:32:24.774 --> 00:32:26.179
(Japan) Wow

806
00:32:26.246 --> 00:32:27.646
People are sick and it's something to see

807
00:32:28.148 --> 00:32:29.400
Do you understand now?

808
00:32:29.467 --> 00:32:30.482
what?

809
00:32:30.549 --> 00:32:31.640
Oh, patient?

810
00:32:31.707 --> 00:32:32.584
no

811
00:32:33.120 --> 00:32:34.652
How itchy it gets if you don’t wash your hair

812
00:32:34.719 --> 00:32:35.567
[Jaeil's laughter leaks out]

813
00:32:35.634 --> 00:32:37.055
(Jaeil) This is the first time I’ve seen you without washing your hair.

814
00:32:37.824 --> 00:32:39.059
[Jaeil’s sniffing sound]

815
00:32:39.126 --> 00:32:40.260
Well!

816
00:32:40.327 --> 00:32:41.460
It smells friendly

817
00:32:41.962 --> 00:32:42.929
Is it the smell of humanity?

818
00:32:42.996 --> 00:32:44.498
Not me!
[Jaeil chuckles]

819
00:32:44.565 --> 00:32:45.564
Nope

820
00:32:50.274 --> 00:32:51.840
(Sabi) Hey, that’s my hospital room.

821
00:32:51.907 --> 00:32:52.871
there is no one

822
00:32:56.210 --> 00:32:58.473
(Jaehwi) As I said during the outpatient clinic,

823
00:32:58.540 --> 00:33:00.773
Those found in the ovaries

824
00:33:00.840 --> 00:33:04.341
In terms of size or shape
It looks positive

825
00:33:04.408 --> 00:33:06.534
And also on ultrasound

826
00:33:06.601 --> 00:33:08.355
Because it looks like a simple thing

827
00:33:08.422 --> 00:33:10.772
I don't think there's anything to worry about.

828
00:33:10.839 --> 00:33:13.518
Ah, well, and yet

829
00:33:13.585 --> 00:33:16.706
Do I have to remove all my ovaries?

830
00:33:16.773 --> 00:33:19.374
(Jaehwi) Yes, because you have already gone through menopause.

831
00:33:19.441 --> 00:33:21.935
Now the ovaries and fallopian tubes

832
00:33:22.002 --> 00:33:23.605
Doesn't do anything

833
00:33:23.672 --> 00:33:26.171
So this time I removed them all

834
00:33:26.773 --> 00:33:28.375
What will happen in the future

835
00:33:28.442 --> 00:33:31.510
the risk of disease
It's better to lower it

836
00:33:32.480 --> 00:33:33.447
(Hyunseon) Yes...

837
00:33:33.514 --> 00:33:35.415
(Jaehwi) Rather than just removing the stains,

838
00:33:35.482 --> 00:33:38.718
The surgery takes less time and is simpler.

839
00:33:38.785 --> 00:33:39.953
You don't have to worry

840
00:33:40.020 --> 00:33:42.487
[Laughing] Yes, to such a good hospital.

841
00:33:43.123 --> 00:33:46.534
I came to a place with good teachers.
It'll work out.

842
00:33:46.601 --> 00:33:47.592
[Hyeonseon’s light smile]

843
00:33:49.441 --> 00:33:50.429
Oh my

844
00:33:52.199 --> 00:33:54.134
No, you are the mother of our major?

845
00:33:54.201 --> 00:33:55.368
[Hyunseon’s laughter]

846
00:33:55.435 --> 00:33:57.804
(Jaehwi) No, why did you do that?
Why, why didn't you tell me?

847
00:33:57.871 --> 00:33:58.738
[Nankyung’s embarrassed laughter]
[lively music]

848
00:33:58.805 --> 00:34:02.042
Oh, I just figured that out too.

849
00:34:02.109 --> 00:34:03.076
Sorry, Professor.

850
00:34:03.143 --> 00:34:04.177
(Jaehwi) What is sorry?

851
00:34:04.244 --> 00:34:06.007
Don't be sorry, no, mother.

852
00:34:06.074 --> 00:34:08.648
Please tell me sooner.
Why don't you talk during outpatient visits?

853
00:34:08.715 --> 00:34:12.484
Ah, I'm busy, but I'm afraid I'm worrying about it for no reason.

854
00:34:12.986 --> 00:34:14.385
(Hyeonseon) For no reason did you come all the way there?

855
00:34:14.452 --> 00:34:16.207
I didn't want to come because I thought it would only cause trouble.

856
00:34:16.274 --> 00:34:20.393
Still, at the hospital with my daughter
Wouldn't it be nice to have surgery?

857
00:34:20.460 --> 00:34:22.896
There is also a discount
[Medical staff and Hyunseon laugh]

858
00:34:22.963 --> 00:34:24.931
(Jaehwi) Welcome mother

859
00:34:24.998 --> 00:34:26.832
- You're welcome, yes.
- (Hyeonseon) Yes

860
00:34:27.901 --> 00:34:29.003
(Jaehwi) Well done

861
00:34:29.070 --> 00:34:31.238
Please take care of our Namgyeong.

862
00:34:31.305 --> 00:34:32.233
(Nankyung) Oh, don’t do it.

863
00:34:32.300 --> 00:34:35.374
(Hyunseon) At home, my dad
Raise me like a princess...

864
00:34:35.441 --> 00:34:37.211
[Hyunseon’s laughter]

865
00:34:37.278 --> 00:34:40.311
Outside, I'm just covering myself
I don't know if I'm going to do it right

866
00:34:40.378 --> 00:34:41.446
[Hyunseon’s laughter]

867
00:34:41.513 --> 00:34:42.407
[Medical staff laugh]

868
00:34:42.474 --> 00:34:43.740
[Nankyung’s embarrassed laughter]

869
00:34:43.807 --> 00:34:46.966
Please take a good look at it.

870
00:34:47.033 --> 00:34:49.422
[Hyunseon’s laughter]
Princess, we will take care of you.

871
00:34:49.489 --> 00:34:52.123
[Medical staff laugh]
[Jaehwi’s laughter]

872
00:34:53.927 --> 00:34:55.226
Wow, boy, what

873
00:34:55.293 --> 00:34:56.995
[Hyunseon’s laughter]
[Eunmi and Juyeon laugh]

874
00:34:58.098 --> 00:34:59.466
(Japan) Princess Pyo

875
00:34:59.533 --> 00:35:01.800
[Jaeil chuckles]
[Medical staff laugh]

876
00:35:02.669 --> 00:35:04.402
(Duri) Are you okay?

877
00:35:06.707 --> 00:35:07.939
(Lee Young) Yes, there is no bleeding.

878
00:35:08.474 --> 00:35:09.673
baby is ok too

879
00:35:09.740 --> 00:35:10.911
don't worry too much

880
00:35:10.978 --> 00:35:13.011
(Duri) Oh well, I’m glad

881
00:35:13.940 --> 00:35:15.374
Ah, but teacher

882
00:35:15.441 --> 00:35:17.882
I can't sleep these days

883
00:35:17.949 --> 00:35:20.540
I seem to wake up once an hour.

884
00:35:20.607 --> 00:35:22.355
Is there any way?

885
00:35:22.422 --> 00:35:26.033
Oh, during pregnancy
Because it is difficult to use medicine carelessly

886
00:35:26.100 --> 00:35:27.661
I can't give you sleeping pills.

887
00:35:27.728 --> 00:35:29.838
[Sighing] I know that.

888
00:35:29.905 --> 00:35:32.764
(Duri) Not being able to sleep
It can't be good for the baby.

889
00:35:33.400 --> 00:35:35.600
Is there any other way besides medicine?

890
00:35:36.637 --> 00:35:39.840
Don't lie too still during the day.

891
00:35:39.907 --> 00:35:41.207
If you move your body a little

892
00:35:41.274 --> 00:35:44.611
Hmm, then suddenly
What should I do if my uterus contracts?

893
00:35:44.678 --> 00:35:47.546
Oh, the movement and the contractions.
It doesn't matter

894
00:35:48.715 --> 00:35:50.348
Are you sure this time?

895
00:35:50.840 --> 00:35:52.317
yes, i'm sure

896
00:35:53.587 --> 00:35:57.222
(Lee Young) The reason I fall asleep is
I don't know what to do...

897
00:35:59.158 --> 00:36:00.142
no

898
00:36:00.627 --> 00:36:02.394
I will ask the professor and come back.

899
00:36:03.163 --> 00:36:05.830
(Yeondu) Even the blood shows in the placenta previa

900
00:36:05.897 --> 00:36:07.801
Of course I can't sleep.

901
00:36:07.868 --> 00:36:11.773
That's all I'm thinking about, worrying about, worrying about.

902
00:36:11.840 --> 00:36:13.872
It's because there's a lot in my head

903
00:36:16.076 --> 00:36:19.540
In such cases, there is a sleeping pill that I use.

904
00:36:19.607 --> 00:36:20.854
Huh? No

905
00:36:20.921 --> 00:36:22.614
If you take medicine that wasn't prescribed, you'll be in big trouble.

906
00:36:22.681 --> 00:36:23.715
[light laughter]

907
00:36:24.467 --> 00:36:25.452
[ding sound effect]

908
00:36:25.519 --> 00:36:27.454
[lively music]

909
00:36:27.521 --> 00:36:30.400
(Yeondu) When I have a lot of thoughts
I need to move my body

910
00:36:30.467 --> 00:36:32.267
We're scared of that too

911
00:36:32.334 --> 00:36:34.058
So, even with a finger like this

912
00:36:34.125 --> 00:36:35.441
Just try to move diligently.

913
00:36:35.508 --> 00:36:36.427
[Yeondu’s laughter]

914
00:36:36.494 --> 00:36:38.697
I already folded 500

915
00:36:41.368 --> 00:36:42.801
[Lee Young’s surprised moan]

916
00:36:44.319 --> 00:36:46.267
Do you really fall asleep when you fold the crane?

917
00:36:46.334 --> 00:36:47.774
Sure

918
00:36:47.841 --> 00:36:49.709
I am a living witness

919
00:36:49.776 --> 00:36:51.409
(Yeondu) Clinical trials are over

920
00:36:52.346 --> 00:36:53.664
thank you

921
00:36:53.731 --> 00:36:55.982
If you still can't sleep, let's talk

922
00:36:56.049 --> 00:36:57.933
Because there is another way

923
00:36:58.000 --> 00:36:59.951
[Soft music]
[Seol-ah’s light smile]

924
00:37:11.079 --> 00:37:12.179
(Lee Young) Hey, the mother.

925
00:37:12.246 --> 00:37:13.798
no, sir

926
00:37:14.835 --> 00:37:16.789
I need to resolve this before the professor comes.

927
00:37:16.856 --> 00:37:18.470
I have nowhere to ask and no time.

928
00:37:18.940 --> 00:37:20.171
I'm in a bit of a hurry

929
00:37:22.776 --> 00:37:24.242
Lee Bo-ryeong's mother's body

930
00:37:25.573 --> 00:37:26.845
You have severe constipation.

931
00:37:27.314 --> 00:37:28.947
You don't want to take laxatives.

932
00:37:29.483 --> 00:37:31.449
Ah, constipation

933
00:37:32.058 --> 00:37:33.151
Well, at times like that

934
00:37:34.788 --> 00:37:35.820
Prune Juice

935
00:37:38.892 --> 00:37:42.393
(Yeondu) This is all me
It's trustworthy because you research it and buy it.

936
00:37:42.460 --> 00:37:45.132
If you order, it will be delivered to the hospital lobby.

937
00:37:45.199 --> 00:37:47.000
I tell you to try this first.

938
00:37:47.067 --> 00:37:49.067
Ah, thank you

939
00:37:53.073 --> 00:37:55.373
(Lee Young) Well, but maybe

940
00:37:57.911 --> 00:38:00.078
Can I eat it too?

941
00:38:01.849 --> 00:38:03.748
Trust me

942
00:38:04.651 --> 00:38:06.265
[devotional music]
I believe

943
00:38:10.023 --> 00:38:11.291
[Sound of mothers talking]

944
00:38:11.358 --> 00:38:14.341
(Lee Young) Everyone?
I've learned a lot

945
00:38:14.408 --> 00:38:15.760
Just this one is straight bread, straight bread

946
00:38:15.827 --> 00:38:18.463
[Yeondu’s light smile]
I just need it too
How about group purchasing?

947
00:38:20.400 --> 00:38:21.968
(Nanjing) Foreigners come secretly

948
00:38:22.035 --> 00:38:24.169
Uh, I didn't mention that I set the surgery date.

949
00:38:25.072 --> 00:38:26.573
I was afraid you would worry

950
00:38:26.640 --> 00:38:28.341
Then let's keep them from finding out until the end, okay?

951
00:38:28.408 --> 00:38:31.007
This is our hospital
Does it make sense that I don't know?

952
00:38:31.074 --> 00:38:34.047
(Hyunseon) Okay, I said I’m sorry.

953
00:38:34.114 --> 00:38:35.213
[Nanjing’s sigh]

954
00:38:36.250 --> 00:38:39.573
Mom, I have surgery tomorrow.
I'm fasting from 12 o'clock today.

955
00:38:39.640 --> 00:38:42.441
Yes, he explained everything earlier.

956
00:38:42.508 --> 00:38:44.224
If you eat anything, the surgery will be cancelled.

957
00:38:44.291 --> 00:38:47.194
Then, professors, nurses, and anesthesiologists
It's all a nuisance

958
00:38:47.261 --> 00:38:48.595
Oh, I knew it.

959
00:38:48.662 --> 00:38:49.529
(Namkyung) Mom

960
00:38:49.596 --> 00:38:53.167
And the nurses
Never bother, eh?

961
00:38:53.234 --> 00:38:54.132
To professors

962
00:38:54.199 --> 00:38:55.909
never say anything

963
00:38:55.976 --> 00:38:57.940
(Hyeonseon) This guy
What do you think I'm talking about?

964
00:38:58.007 --> 00:38:59.739
(Nankyung) Mom, don’t even ask questions.

965
00:38:59.806 --> 00:39:00.807
ask me

966
00:39:00.874 --> 00:39:03.807
mom and
Please don't talk about me here

967
00:39:03.874 --> 00:39:05.506
This is my workplace

968
00:39:05.573 --> 00:39:06.477
I knew

969
00:39:06.544 --> 00:39:09.210
you sound the same
How many times have I repeated this, haha...

970
00:39:10.807 --> 00:39:13.320
Hey, have you eaten? What did you eat?

971
00:39:13.387 --> 00:39:14.454
(Nankyung) I just picked up the bread and ate it.

972
00:39:14.521 --> 00:39:15.537
(Hyeonseon) Oh, why are you eating bread?

973
00:39:15.604 --> 00:39:16.966
(Nanjing) Oh, I don’t have time.

974
00:39:17.033 --> 00:39:18.840
(Hyeonseon) Oh, let’s eat.

975
00:39:18.907 --> 00:39:20.074
Young kids these days

976
00:39:20.141 --> 00:39:21.928
My immunity is weakened because I don't eat.

977
00:39:21.995 --> 00:39:23.561
That came out in Dongchimi

978
00:39:23.628 --> 00:39:24.664
I knew

979
00:39:24.731 --> 00:39:27.100
(Hyunseon) Hey, since you came
take some dumplings

980
00:39:27.167 --> 00:39:29.469
I brought a lot to share

981
00:39:29.536 --> 00:39:31.505
(Namkyung) Ah, mom later, later

982
00:39:31.572 --> 00:39:35.140
(Hyeonseon) No, hey
These days, you have to wait in line to eat our dumplings.

983
00:39:35.207 --> 00:39:36.174
It's precious

984
00:39:36.241 --> 00:39:39.413
Mom, people here don’t like dumplings.

985
00:39:39.913 --> 00:39:41.615
[Mobile phone call incoming sound]

986
00:39:41.682 --> 00:39:42.915
(Namkyung) Oh my, oh my, I really have to go

987
00:39:42.982 --> 00:39:44.017
(Hyeonseon) Hey, just eat one and go.

988
00:39:44.084 --> 00:39:44.982
(Namkyung) Oh, Mom, please

989
00:39:45.049 --> 00:39:46.586
(Hyeonseon) No
Just put one in your mouth and go.

990
00:39:46.653 --> 00:39:48.062
(Nam-kyung) [Screaming] Mom!

991
00:39:48.129 --> 00:39:49.456
Oh, I really don't eat!

992
00:39:49.523 --> 00:39:52.457
I'm busy right now, I'm working!

993
00:39:53.694 --> 00:39:54.726
[Exasperated exclamation]

994
00:39:55.662 --> 00:39:57.629
Ah, the nature is

995
00:39:59.240 --> 00:40:00.934
(Hyeonseon) My temperament is, tsk

996
00:40:01.001 --> 00:40:03.170
Oh, I told you I don't eat it.

997
00:40:03.237 --> 00:40:04.502
(Hyeonseon) Okay!

998
00:40:05.300 --> 00:40:06.437
[Put the lid on]

999
00:40:09.476 --> 00:40:11.866
[Sound of lid closing]
Are you coming later after work?

1000
00:40:13.881 --> 00:40:14.746
(Nanjing) Uh

1001
00:40:15.333 --> 00:40:16.233
What time?

1002
00:40:16.300 --> 00:40:17.362
When are you coming?

1003
00:40:17.429 --> 00:40:20.285
Have you eaten?
Should my mom steam these dumplings and wait?

1004
00:40:20.954 --> 00:40:21.940
(Nanjing) I don’t know

1005
00:40:22.007 --> 00:40:23.921
- I have to go first.
- (Hyunseon) Uh, go, go, go, go

1006
00:40:23.988 --> 00:40:24.822
- Mom
- (Hyeonseon) Huh?

1007
00:40:24.889 --> 00:40:26.731
- Don't really talk about me.
- I don't do it.

1008
00:40:26.798 --> 00:40:28.400
(Namkyung) Oh, so don’t really do it.
[Hyun-seon agrees]

1009
00:40:28.929 --> 00:40:30.395
- I'm leaving.
- (Hyeonseon) Go, go, go

1010
00:40:32.165 --> 00:40:33.364
[Sound of door opening]
[Hyunseon’s laughter]

1011
00:40:34.866 --> 00:40:36.710
[Sound of grass bugs crying]

1012
00:40:36.777 --> 00:40:38.810
[TV sound]

1013
00:40:40.307 --> 00:40:42.841
(Seungwon) This Chuseok
My father is coming up

1014
00:40:42.908 --> 00:40:44.209
I got a call during the day

1015
00:40:44.878 --> 00:40:45.942
- (Jooyoung) Really?
- (Seungwon) Yes

1016
00:40:46.009 --> 00:40:48.680
So is my sister-in-law.
He said it would be difficult for him to come down too.

1017
00:40:50.329 --> 00:40:51.316
(Jooyoung) What am I?

1018
00:40:53.259 --> 00:40:54.591
You didn't say that, right?

1019
00:40:55.341 --> 00:40:56.287
(Seungwon) What?

1020
00:40:58.840 --> 00:41:00.393
I have infertility treatment

1021
00:41:00.460 --> 00:41:02.697
You didn't tell Dad you were doing it again, right?

1022
00:41:02.764 --> 00:41:03.797
I didn't do it

1023
00:41:03.864 --> 00:41:05.029
Don't worry

1024
00:41:05.899 --> 00:41:07.889
I know you're upset, so what are you going to do?

1025
00:41:09.002 --> 00:41:10.668
- Good job.
- (Seungwon) Yes

1026
00:41:11.301 --> 00:41:14.005
Ah, but why did you cry in your sleep last night?

1027
00:41:16.243 --> 00:41:17.242
(Jooyoung) Ah...

1028
00:41:18.478 --> 00:41:19.907
in a dream

1029
00:41:19.974 --> 00:41:21.681
That day has come again

1030
00:41:21.748 --> 00:41:24.618
Ah, the day you cried the most in your life?

1031
00:41:24.685 --> 00:41:25.583
(Jooyoung) Yes

1032
00:41:26.320 --> 00:41:27.285
[light laughter]

1033
00:41:28.088 --> 00:41:29.954
This time, I just cried in my dream.

1034
00:41:31.124 --> 00:41:34.592
Wow, my throat is really clogged.
I couldn't breathe

1035
00:41:35.963 --> 00:41:38.225
So I can't even scream
I woke up struggling.

