1280
00:52:09.793 --> 00:52:11.228
Um...

1281
00:52:11.732 --> 00:52:13.188
My younger brother

1282
00:52:13.874 --> 00:52:16.507
Can we go together or not?

1283
00:52:16.574 --> 00:52:18.071
Mom will ask

1284
00:52:18.138 --> 00:52:19.236
(They) Okay

1285
00:52:19.737 --> 00:52:21.171
I'm playing and watching TV

1286
00:52:22.074 --> 00:52:23.443
I love you

1287
00:52:23.510 --> 00:52:24.811
[Yeondu’s laughter]

1288
00:52:24.878 --> 00:52:26.041
(Sani) Yes, I love you

1289
00:52:26.108 --> 00:52:27.545
I love you

1290
00:52:28.815 --> 00:52:29.747
[Call end sound]

1291
00:52:39.341 --> 00:52:40.824
[Yeondu’s cry]

1292
00:52:49.601 --> 00:52:51.601
[Sobbing]

1293
00:52:55.501 --> 00:52:57.501
[Sad music]

1294
00:52:58.779 --> 00:53:00.444
[Crying]

1295
00:53:01.607 --> 00:53:05.015
(Do-won) This morning, on the routine NST test,
There was nothing wrong

1296
00:53:05.760 --> 00:53:08.093
A little while ago, the mother
Because the baby is not playing well

1297
00:53:08.734 --> 00:53:10.721
NST was performed again.

1298
00:53:10.788 --> 00:53:12.289
I can't catch the hotbang.

1299
00:53:13.896 --> 00:53:15.092
I saw Sono

1300
00:53:15.796 --> 00:53:17.861
Looks like IUFD

1301
00:53:21.368 --> 00:53:22.627
What are the other signs?

1302
00:53:23.674 --> 00:53:26.873
Well, the rap is clean too.
You didn’t have any special symptoms

1303
00:53:26.940 --> 00:53:28.005
(Jeongmin) Yes

1304
00:53:30.040 --> 00:53:32.874
So what should we do now?

1305
00:53:32.941 --> 00:53:34.444
(Do-won) It was adjusted to be the first case of surgery.

1306
00:53:34.511 --> 00:53:36.246
I will contact your guardian and ask you to come.

1307
00:53:36.714 --> 00:53:37.834
(Jeongmin) Uh...

1308
00:53:37.901 --> 00:53:40.918
So what should I do now?

1309
00:53:41.841 --> 00:53:42.753
yes?

1310
00:53:44.241 --> 00:53:45.689
medical explanation

1311
00:53:46.426 --> 00:53:49.093
I wonder if there is meaning in giving it to you.

1312
00:53:49.941 --> 00:53:51.762
If you think about it as a mother,

1313
00:53:52.699 --> 00:53:54.301
I'm even more speechless

1314
00:53:55.767 --> 00:53:57.601
(Jeongmin) Let’s say I have nothing to say.

1315
00:53:58.166 --> 00:53:59.573
That's just one word

1316
00:53:59.640 --> 00:54:01.174
[Dowon’s sigh]

1317
00:54:01.241 --> 00:54:03.006
I don't know what to say

1318
00:54:07.181 --> 00:54:09.901
[Yeondu’s cry]

1319
00:54:09.968 --> 00:54:12.460
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1320
00:54:18.909 --> 00:54:20.090
[sigh]

1321
00:54:20.961 --> 00:54:23.360
[Yeondu’s sobbing]

1322
00:54:31.341 --> 00:54:32.840
Description of the surgery

1323
00:54:32.907 --> 00:54:34.740
I'll do it, just prepare the consent form.

1324
00:54:34.807 --> 00:54:35.806
no

1325
00:54:38.245 --> 00:54:39.515
I will do it

1326
00:54:46.216 --> 00:54:49.053
[Nankyung’s heavy breathing]

1327
00:54:55.295 --> 00:54:57.094
(Savi) The abdominal cavity was clean with no adhesions.

1328
00:54:57.161 --> 00:54:59.796
Or even with the naked eye
They said it looked completely like B-9.

1329
00:54:59.863 --> 00:55:01.231
(Nanjing) [Relieved] Thank goodness

1330
00:55:01.702 --> 00:55:03.518
(Sabi) I see that it was finished in 20 minutes.

1331
00:55:03.585 --> 00:55:04.971
I don't think there will be any problem

1332
00:55:05.038 --> 00:55:05.900
(Nanjing) Uh

1333
00:55:09.042 --> 00:55:10.974
(Sabi) The belly button closed very nicely too.

1334
00:55:11.041 --> 00:55:12.509
(Namkyung) Ha, that’s right

1335
00:55:14.011 --> 00:55:15.534
(Sabi) You said you get cold a lot.
Because I remembered

1336
00:55:15.601 --> 00:55:17.840
When leaving the operating room
I covered you with 3 more sheets.

1337
00:55:17.907 --> 00:55:18.782
You?

1338
00:55:19.341 --> 00:55:21.167
Hey, you are a patient too

1339
00:55:21.234 --> 00:55:22.856
Uh, so I know.

1340
00:55:22.923 --> 00:55:25.389
Haha, it really doesn't matter.

1341
00:55:26.226 --> 00:55:27.658
[Hyeon-seon’s groans of difficulty]

1342
00:55:28.262 --> 00:55:30.096
Mom, are you okay?

1343
00:55:30.163 --> 00:55:31.298
Does it hurt a lot?

1344
00:55:31.365 --> 00:55:32.529
[Hyeon-seon’s painful breathing]

1345
00:55:33.433 --> 00:55:34.832
It hurts

1346
00:55:36.770 --> 00:55:38.138
[Hyeon-seon’s moans of pain]

1347
00:55:38.205 --> 00:55:40.370
Mother, it is true that you are very sick.

1348
00:55:41.275 --> 00:55:44.942
It's right after surgery, so my ribs and wings are broken.
It'll feel like you're just squeezing it out.

1349
00:55:45.542 --> 00:55:47.911
It hurts for the next three or four hours.

1350
00:55:48.849 --> 00:55:50.222
I'm not okay for a while

1351
00:55:50.901 --> 00:55:52.065
[Hyeon-seon’s painful breathing]

1352
00:55:52.619 --> 00:55:53.974
(Sabi) I’ll be your doctor today

1353
00:55:54.041 --> 00:55:55.152
There's nothing to do anyway

1354
00:55:55.807 --> 00:55:56.987
Thank you, Sabiya

1355
00:55:59.459 --> 00:56:01.125
[Mobile phone call incoming sound]
(Namkyung) Huh?

1356
00:56:02.241 --> 00:56:03.600
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1357
00:56:03.667 --> 00:56:05.429
mom, i have to go

1358
00:56:05.941 --> 00:56:08.074
Mom, if you’re sick, don’t hold back.

1359
00:56:08.141 --> 00:56:10.868
Talk to Sabi here.
I'm going to give you painkillers, okay?

1360
00:56:12.472 --> 00:56:13.871
I'm leaving, please take care of me

1361
00:56:15.475 --> 00:56:16.707
Nam Kyung Ah

1362
00:56:18.378 --> 00:56:20.114
uh? Mom, why?

1363
00:56:22.549 --> 00:56:24.423
Not bread

1364
00:56:26.520 --> 00:56:27.697
eat

1365
00:56:28.734 --> 00:56:29.723
[Calm music]

1366
00:56:29.790 --> 00:56:30.740
[Heavy sigh]

1367
00:56:31.755 --> 00:56:34.324
No, what time is it now and do you want to eat?

1368
00:56:34.858 --> 00:56:36.997
Eat...

1369
00:56:37.064 --> 00:56:39.496
Okay, I'll eat.

1370
00:56:45.806 --> 00:56:47.402
[rustling sound]

1371
00:56:54.367 --> 00:56:55.379
Have a meal

1372
00:56:58.649 --> 00:57:00.484
It's been a while since you had lunch

1373
00:57:17.474 --> 00:57:18.402
[Lee Young sighs]

1374
00:57:25.445 --> 00:57:26.580
[Sound of signing]

1375
00:57:26.647 --> 00:57:27.718
suddenly

1376
00:57:30.441 --> 00:57:32.115
Because something unexpected happened

1377
00:57:35.722 --> 00:57:37.435
(Lee Young) You worked hard

1378
00:57:41.261 --> 00:57:42.292
teacher

1379
00:57:43.564 --> 00:57:44.583
Yes?

1380
00:57:53.507 --> 00:57:55.074
The surgery is tomorrow morning.

1381
00:57:55.141 --> 00:57:57.177
(Lee Young) I’m fasting from midnight today.

1382
00:57:57.244 --> 00:57:59.810
After surgery tomorrow, for 6 hours
can't eat

1383
00:58:00.974 --> 00:58:01.979
yes

1384
00:58:02.482 --> 00:58:03.488
So

1385
00:58:06.787 --> 00:58:08.265
If you don't eat now

1386
00:58:10.224 --> 00:58:12.105
You'll be hungry at dawn

1387
00:58:19.008 --> 00:58:20.063
Then

1388
00:58:23.370 --> 00:58:26.198
In the meantime, I'm hungry
They say I hate it so much and it’s terrible.

1389
00:58:27.074 --> 00:58:28.538
I wonder if it's my mom

1390
00:58:37.475 --> 00:58:38.827
My sister said that.

1391
00:58:40.854 --> 00:58:42.552
I’m a person who doesn’t usually cry.

1392
00:58:46.426 --> 00:58:48.410
I cried a lot at that time.

1393
00:58:48.968 --> 00:58:50.230
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1394
00:58:50.297 --> 00:58:52.329
As soon as I opened my eyes the next morning

1395
00:58:53.230 --> 00:58:55.032
I cried because I was hungry again.

1396
00:58:58.335 --> 00:59:00.704
What if the baby is hungry like me?

1397
00:59:02.873 --> 00:59:04.441
Because he didn't eat

1398
00:59:05.033 --> 00:59:08.011
I wonder if the baby didn't eat anything either.

1399
00:59:09.441 --> 00:59:11.615
I am now baby food

1400
00:59:12.174 --> 00:59:14.217
Even though I said I didn't need it

1401
00:59:16.256 --> 00:59:17.470
It was no use

1402
00:59:24.174 --> 00:59:25.262
[Lee Young sighs]

1403
00:59:26.096 --> 00:59:29.266
It's already been more than 5 years

1404
00:59:30.200 --> 00:59:32.336
That day still comes to my dreams sometimes.

1405
00:59:35.734 --> 00:59:37.174
[sniffling sound]

1406
00:59:39.346 --> 00:59:40.410
So

1407
00:59:41.211 --> 00:59:42.846
Try it by force.

1408
00:59:44.885 --> 00:59:46.127
I'm going to be very sad

1409
00:59:47.154 --> 00:59:49.065
It's better if you don't even think like this.

1410
00:59:49.607 --> 00:59:51.488
[shaking breathing]

1411
00:59:57.931 --> 00:59:59.763
[Yeondu’s crying]

1412
01:00:01.601 --> 01:00:03.601
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST-Continued]

1413
01:00:19.753 --> 01:00:20.812
[sniffling sound]

1414
01:00:40.073 --> 01:00:42.372
[Yeondu’s cry]

1415
01:00:55.122 --> 01:00:56.520
[Yeondu’s whimpering sound]

1416
01:01:02.896 --> 01:01:04.573
(Hyunseon) Ah, it’s delicious.

1417
01:01:04.640 --> 01:01:05.595
(Namkyung) Doesn’t it hurt?

1418
01:01:05.662 --> 01:01:06.640
Aren’t you pulling your stomach?

1419
01:01:06.707 --> 01:01:09.774
Yeah, I guess the surgery went well.

1420
01:01:09.841 --> 01:01:12.333
Oh, what about painkillers? Did you eat?

1421
01:01:12.400 --> 01:01:15.705
Yes, teacher Sabi next to me measured the time.
He gave it to me hard.

1422
01:01:18.708 --> 01:01:20.577
You two are best friends?

1423
01:01:20.644 --> 01:01:21.945
(Namkyung) Huh?

1424
01:01:22.012 --> 01:01:23.613
Uh, uh

1425
01:01:24.280 --> 01:01:25.500
Well...
[Awkward laughter]

1426
01:01:25.567 --> 01:01:27.141
(Hyeonseon) Were you busy today too?

1427
01:01:27.208 --> 01:01:28.452
(Nanjing) I was busy

1428
01:01:29.189 --> 01:01:30.887
I have to go into surgery again later.

1429
01:01:33.054 --> 01:01:33.927
What surgery?

1430
01:01:33.994 --> 01:01:35.459
Do you know what my mom says?

1431
01:01:39.375 --> 01:01:42.465
No, whose surgery is this?

1432
01:01:42.532 --> 01:01:44.041
I always said

1433
01:01:44.108 --> 01:01:45.001
A devilish grandmother?

1434
01:01:45.068 --> 01:01:46.403
no
[Hyun-seon takes a breath]

1435
01:01:47.774 --> 01:01:50.867
Oh, they always get angry in that operating room.

1436
01:01:50.934 --> 01:01:52.041
(Hyeon-seon) What was it?
[humorous music]

1437
01:01:52.108 --> 01:01:54.014
Was it something like a devil?

1438
01:01:54.081 --> 01:01:55.440
ball! What was it?

1439
01:01:55.507 --> 01:01:57.740
Mom, be quiet, who can hear?

1440
01:01:57.807 --> 01:01:58.748
no

1441
01:01:58.815 --> 01:02:02.752
Even if I meet you at the hospital
I was trying to say something

1442
01:02:02.819 --> 01:02:04.087
(Hyeon-seon) Will someone please stop scolding me?

1443
01:02:04.154 --> 01:02:07.033
Why are you being so mean to kids?
I must be crazy, really.

1444
01:02:07.100 --> 01:02:08.715
(Nankyung) No, what do you say?

1445
01:02:08.782 --> 01:02:10.707
Mom, you really just do it, really?

1446
01:02:10.774 --> 01:02:11.995
(Kiseon) Teacher Pyo Nam-gyeong?

1447
01:02:14.067 --> 01:02:14.931
(Nanjing) Ah

1448
01:02:14.998 --> 01:02:16.141
Hello, professor?

1449
01:02:16.208 --> 01:02:17.534
Isn’t our surgery coming soon?

1450
01:02:17.601 --> 01:02:18.535
What are you doing here?

1451
01:02:18.602 --> 01:02:19.435
(Nanjing) Ah

1452
01:02:19.502 --> 01:02:20.637
I'm not doing anything

1453
01:02:21.137 --> 01:02:22.205
I'm going now

1454
01:02:25.341 --> 01:02:27.467
Hello, professor?

1455
01:02:27.534 --> 01:02:29.540
[humorous music]

1456
01:02:29.607 --> 01:02:30.647
That

1457
01:02:32.586 --> 01:02:35.589
Namkyung is the one who becomes the mother.

1458
01:02:35.656 --> 01:02:37.324
[Surprising elasticity]
[Nankyung’s awkward laughter]

1459
01:02:37.391 --> 01:02:38.974
(Kiseon) Hello?

1460
01:02:39.041 --> 01:02:41.107
My name is Professor Gong Gong-seon.

1461
01:02:41.174 --> 01:02:43.226
I'm working with Namkyung.

1462
01:02:44.107 --> 01:02:45.365
Did you have a successful surgery?

1463
01:02:45.432 --> 01:02:46.596
(Hyeonseon) Ah, yes

1464
01:02:49.427 --> 01:02:51.268
To our Namgyeong

1465
01:02:52.573 --> 01:02:54.400
I heard a lot about it

1466
01:02:54.467 --> 01:02:56.139
[nervous music]

1467
01:02:59.534 --> 01:03:00.544
Hey...

1468
01:03:02.216 --> 01:03:03.254
Professor

1469
01:03:06.850 --> 01:03:08.121
my child

1470
01:03:15.041 --> 01:03:17.731
There are so many things lacking

1471
01:03:17.798 --> 01:03:21.233
He said he would try to raise us well.

1472
01:03:21.300 --> 01:03:23.540
There are probably a lot of things you don't like.

1473
01:03:23.607 --> 01:03:26.233
Ah, this is from great professors.

1474
01:03:26.300 --> 01:03:28.774
I'm afraid I'm causing trouble

1475
01:03:28.841 --> 01:03:30.640
I'm sorry for everything

1476
01:03:30.707 --> 01:03:32.509
Ugh, no.

1477
01:03:33.241 --> 01:03:35.567
This is so great, our teacher Namkyung Pyo.

1478
01:03:35.634 --> 01:03:37.540
(Hyunseon) Oh, thank you

1479
01:03:37.607 --> 01:03:40.016
Oh my, thank you

1480
01:03:40.657 --> 01:03:42.318
[Calm music]
Thanks to the great professor

1481
01:03:42.385 --> 01:03:44.200
This guy is pretending to be a person.

1482
01:03:44.267 --> 01:03:46.066
I really wish you all the best in the future.

1483
01:03:46.133 --> 01:03:48.634
Oh no, don't worry

1484
01:03:48.701 --> 01:03:51.074
[Kiseon’s laughter]

1485
01:03:51.141 --> 01:03:54.041
Slowly... come, Mr. Pyo Nam-kyung.

1486
01:03:54.108 --> 01:03:55.374
(Namkyung) Ah...

1487
01:03:55.441 --> 01:03:57.537
- (Kiseon) Then
- (Hyeonseon) Oh, yes.

1488
01:03:57.604 --> 01:03:59.766
- (Nanjing) Take care.
- (Hyeonseon) Take care of yourselves.

1489
01:04:00.674 --> 01:04:01.739
[Sigh of relief]

1490
01:04:02.543 --> 01:04:04.945
Oh, you were really surprised!
[Hyunseon’s laughter]

1491
01:04:05.012 --> 01:04:05.976
ball

1492
01:04:06.713 --> 01:04:08.949
- Right, right.
- (Hyunseon) Just write evil

1493
01:04:09.016 --> 01:04:10.780
(Nanjing) Be quiet, listen.

1494
01:04:10.847 --> 01:04:11.718
[Hyeon-seon’s mischievous laughter]

1495
01:04:11.785 --> 01:04:14.417
Oh, really, don't play around.

1496
01:04:16.720 --> 01:04:18.734
[Calm music]
(Lee Young) Are you happy that we’re making a comeback?

1497
01:04:18.801 --> 01:04:19.974
[Force machine operation sound]

1498
01:04:20.041 --> 01:04:21.858
(Japan) Professor
I told you to rest until the weekend.

1499
01:04:23.226 --> 01:04:25.332
Yeah, that's good posture.

1500
01:04:25.399 --> 01:04:28.231
(Lee Young) If you find yourself lacking while working, tell me
can you give me some of mine

1501
01:04:28.298 --> 01:04:30.133
(Jaeil) Me too, I can give a lot too

1502
01:04:30.704 --> 01:04:31.698
(Sabi) After seeing

1503
01:04:33.369 --> 01:04:34.774
I'm shooting this to commemorate my discharge from the hospital.

1504
01:04:34.841 --> 01:04:36.300
- (Japan) Oh yeah
- (Lee Young) Oh

1505
01:04:36.367 --> 01:04:38.907
- (Jaeil) I am a chocolate honey pong crush
- (Lee Young) Me too

1506
01:04:38.974 --> 01:04:40.643
[Force machine operation sound]
(Sabi) Two cups of chocolate pong crush

1507
01:04:40.710 --> 01:04:42.974
Please give me a cup of warm Americano.

1508
01:04:43.041 --> 01:04:44.976
Namgyeong...

1509
01:04:45.043 --> 01:04:46.507
(Jaeil) Ah, one drink, mega size.

1510
01:04:46.574 --> 01:04:47.807
(clerk) Yes

1511
01:04:47.874 --> 01:04:48.918
(private money) and

1512
01:04:48.985 --> 01:04:50.920
Please give me a cup of warm peppermint tea, too.

1513
01:04:51.491 --> 01:04:52.667
Five drinks in total, right?

1514
01:04:52.734 --> 01:04:53.690
yes, that's right

1515
01:04:53.757 --> 01:04:54.724
(Sabi) Thank you

1516
01:04:55.762 --> 01:04:57.093
Please give me this too
[Receipt printing sound]

1517
01:04:59.333 --> 01:05:00.830
- (Clerk) Thank you.
- (Sabi) Yes

1518
01:05:05.341 --> 01:05:06.836
(Lee Young) You are an outpatient next week, right?

1519
01:05:07.674 --> 01:05:10.239
(Sabi) Are you feeling dizzy?
If you feel pain in the area where the surgery was performed

1520
01:05:10.306 --> 01:05:11.912
Don't wait until you are an outpatient, come right away.

1521
01:05:11.979 --> 01:05:13.242
- (Hyeonseon) Can I come right away?
- (Sabi) Yes

1522
01:05:13.309 --> 01:05:15.178
Oh my god, thank you so much

1523
01:05:15.245 --> 01:05:17.714
(Hyunseon) Please take care of our Namgyeong.

1524
01:05:17.781 --> 01:05:21.007
It's so reassuring
I have such good friends

1525
01:05:21.074 --> 01:05:22.319
[Hyunseon’s laughter]

1526
01:05:27.991 --> 01:05:29.434
(Nanjing) If a store closes for a day, will it go out of business?

1527
01:05:29.501 --> 01:05:31.207
I told you to go after lunch

1528
01:05:31.274 --> 01:05:33.207
(Hyeonseon) Dad suffers alone.

1529
01:05:33.274 --> 01:05:34.431
[Nanjing’s sigh]

1530
01:05:35.141 --> 01:05:37.007
tell your friends

1531
01:05:37.074 --> 01:05:39.233
Thank you for coming to say hello

1532
01:05:39.300 --> 01:05:41.707
Thank you for enjoying the dumplings

1533
01:05:41.774 --> 01:05:45.141
Thank you for getting along well with our Namgyeong.

1534
01:05:45.208 --> 01:05:46.242
(Nanjing) Uh

1535
01:05:47.725 --> 01:05:49.049
(Hyeon-seon) I think there will be a bus?

1536
01:05:49.116 --> 01:05:50.947
Oh, you can take a taxi on the day you leave the hospital.

1537
01:05:51.014 --> 01:05:52.200
I'm fine, but

1538
01:05:52.267 --> 01:05:54.640
Mom, I already paid.

1539
01:05:54.707 --> 01:05:56.756
If you don't ride this, you're wasting your money.
Aren't you going to ride?

1540
01:05:56.823 --> 01:05:58.988
Ah, you are useless.
Spend money!

1541
01:05:59.055 --> 01:06:01.707
Just ride it, saving money won't make you rich.

1542
01:06:01.774 --> 01:06:03.860
Okay, don't be annoyed.

1543
01:06:04.498 --> 01:06:05.385
(Namkyung) Yes

1544
01:06:07.764 --> 01:06:10.133
Mom, don’t come to the hospital anymore.

1545
01:06:11.901 --> 01:06:13.607
No, I'm already busy.

1546
01:06:13.674 --> 01:06:16.039
Mom, it’s annoying for me to come.

1547
01:06:17.507 --> 01:06:18.441
Ugh

1548
01:06:19.242 --> 01:06:20.210
So

1549
01:06:21.077 --> 01:06:22.312
Don't get sick

1550
01:06:26.220 --> 01:06:27.217
Okay

1551
01:06:35.225 --> 01:06:37.740
Are you surprised that I asked you to go to a big hospital?

1552
01:06:37.807 --> 01:06:38.795
(Hyunseon) Yes

1553
01:06:39.499 --> 01:06:43.133
My eyes are turning white
My heart was pounding

1554
01:06:44.667 --> 01:06:46.870
Were you scared during the surgery?

1555
01:06:47.741 --> 01:06:48.638
(Hyunseon) Yes

1556
01:06:49.743 --> 01:06:50.874
Almost

1557
01:06:52.779 --> 01:06:53.882
I almost cried

1558
01:06:55.078 --> 01:06:56.846
The hospital bed is also uncomfortable.

1559
01:06:57.918 --> 01:06:59.282
Was it hard, Mom?

1560
01:07:00.053 --> 01:07:00.996
no?

1561
01:07:04.291 --> 01:07:06.039
I loved it so much

1562
01:07:06.894 --> 01:07:07.667
(Namkyung) Huh?

1563
01:07:07.734 --> 01:07:09.763
It's your first time since middle school.

1564
01:07:09.830 --> 01:07:12.529
Sleeping with my daughter

1565
01:07:13.974 --> 01:07:18.835
(Hyunseon) I had a really happy 3 days and 2 nights.

1566
01:07:20.937 --> 01:07:23.044
[Calm music]
[Heavy breathing]

1567
01:07:23.111 --> 01:07:24.801
Why do you say that?

1568
01:07:24.868 --> 01:07:26.101
(Hyeonseon) Oh my, why is he like this?

1569
01:07:27.262 --> 01:07:28.912
[Crying sound]

1570
01:07:30.141 --> 01:07:31.418
How are you?

1571
01:07:31.485 --> 01:07:32.767
Indeed

1572
01:07:32.834 --> 01:07:35.418
Hey, just look at your mom
I lost my temper like that...

1573
01:07:36.653 --> 01:07:37.654
[Heavy breathing]

1574
01:07:38.592 --> 01:07:39.622
[Namkyung’s crying]

1575
01:07:40.127 --> 01:07:41.424
mom

1576
01:07:42.229 --> 01:07:43.707
(Hyunseon) Don’t cry, okay?

1577
01:07:43.774 --> 01:07:45.194
(Namkyung) Mom

1578
01:07:45.261 --> 01:07:48.135
Stop crying, okay?

1579
01:07:48.202 --> 01:07:49.300
(Namkyung) Yes

1580
01:07:50.241 --> 01:07:52.001
- (Hyeonseon) Don’t cry.
- Mom...

1581
01:07:52.806 --> 01:07:53.870
don't cry

1582
01:07:55.442 --> 01:07:56.777
[light laughter]

1583
01:07:56.844 --> 01:08:00.219
(Namkyung) [Crying] Mom...

1584
01:08:05.919 --> 01:08:07.621
(Hyunseon) You’re still a baby

1585
01:08:07.688 --> 01:08:09.786
[Hyunseon’s laughter]
[Nankyung’s Crying]

1586
01:08:14.761 --> 01:08:16.163
(Dowon) Wow, they’re eating among themselves again.

1587
01:08:16.230 --> 01:08:17.674
(together) hello

1588
01:08:17.741 --> 01:08:19.362
(Do-won) Nam-kyung, did your mother do well after being discharged?

1589
01:08:19.429 --> 01:08:20.774
yes, welcome

1590
01:08:20.841 --> 01:08:22.640
(Dowon) Oh my, you had a hard time

1591
01:08:22.707 --> 01:08:24.467
(Nanjing) Thank you
[cell phone vibrating sound]

1592
01:08:29.540 --> 01:08:31.645
Huh? Isn’t that Lee Young’s phone?

1593
01:08:31.712 --> 01:08:33.543
(Jae-il) Hey, look at your head.

1594
01:08:33.610 --> 01:08:34.933
How quickly did you go

1595
01:08:35.000 --> 01:08:36.650
If I hadn't told you

1596
01:08:36.717 --> 01:08:38.123
He wore scrubs and pants, he

1597
01:08:41.455 --> 01:08:42.385
Take it

1598
01:08:47.857 --> 01:08:49.926
Yes, this is Oh Yi-young’s cell phone.

1599
01:08:51.765 --> 01:08:53.000
What are you a thief?

1600
01:08:53.067 --> 01:08:55.031
(Namkyung) Don’t you even hear my voice?

1601
01:08:55.098 --> 01:08:56.733
You left your cell phone at the medical office.

1602
01:08:57.437 --> 01:08:59.969
Uh, I'll put it on the desk.
take it

1603
01:09:00.440 --> 01:09:01.404
uh

1604
01:09:02.546 --> 01:09:03.410
[Call end sound]

1605
01:09:03.477 --> 01:09:04.607
(Sabi) Where did Oh Yi-young go?

1606
01:09:05.507 --> 01:09:06.640
(Japan) I heard you have dinner plans?

1607
01:09:06.707 --> 01:09:08.311
Oh, with whom?

1608
01:09:08.941 --> 01:09:10.980
I don’t know who it is, but it looks like a man.

1609
01:09:11.485 --> 01:09:12.767
(Jaeil) How do you know that?

1610
01:09:12.834 --> 01:09:15.622
(Namkyung) At that time, my friend was like, whatever, what is that?

1611
01:09:15.689 --> 01:09:16.601
That?

1612
01:09:17.086 --> 01:09:19.105
Hey, Sabi, you weren’t there then so you didn’t hear it, right?

1613
01:09:19.172 --> 01:09:20.957
(Nanjing) Someone asked me to eat with them.

1614
01:09:21.024 --> 01:09:22.667
Is it because I’m thankful for this?

1615
01:09:22.734 --> 01:09:24.740
I asked if it was because I liked it.

1616
01:09:24.807 --> 01:09:25.762
(Sabi) But?

1617
01:09:26.300 --> 01:09:27.588
(Namkyung) They say it’s about a friend.

1618
01:09:27.655 --> 01:09:29.966
what are friends
Hey, it's a total joke

1619
01:09:30.033 --> 01:09:32.469
- Have you ever seen her meet a friend?
- (private money) None.

1620
01:09:32.536 --> 01:09:34.938
(Namkyung) So, you’re meeting a man.

1621
01:09:35.968 --> 01:09:37.174
(Employee) Welcome

1622
01:09:37.241 --> 01:09:38.641
What is the name of the person who made the reservation?

1623
01:09:38.708 --> 01:09:40.707
Ham Dong-ho

1624
01:09:40.774 --> 01:09:42.044
I'll take you to your room.

1625
01:09:42.111 --> 01:09:43.640
Room, room?

1626
01:09:43.707 --> 01:09:44.814
(Employee) This way

1627
01:09:53.760 --> 01:09:54.844
This way

1628
01:10:02.341 --> 01:10:03.433
[sigh]

1629
01:10:04.638 --> 01:10:05.907
[Knocking sound]

1630
01:10:05.974 --> 01:10:06.970
(Dongho) Yes

1631
01:10:19.987 --> 01:10:20.983
(Mugang) Huh?

1632
01:10:21.050 --> 01:10:23.540
Teacher Oh I-young didn’t come.
I was nervous because I thought there was an emergency.

1633
01:10:23.607 --> 01:10:24.667
No, right?

1634
01:10:24.734 --> 01:10:25.521
(Lee Young) Yes

1635
01:10:25.588 --> 01:10:27.790
(Junseok) Now, the food is
Our teacher Ham Dong-ho

1636
01:10:27.857 --> 01:10:29.107
He said he ordered it himself.

1637
01:10:29.174 --> 01:10:31.364
(Sanghyun) Can I have a drink today?
sit down, quickly

1638
01:10:31.431 --> 01:10:32.400
(Mu-gang) Come quickly

1639
01:10:32.467 --> 01:10:34.308
(Dongho) That’s right
We all worked hard together that day.

1640
01:10:34.375 --> 01:10:35.500
We have to have an after-party once.

1641
01:10:35.567 --> 01:10:36.766
(Mugang) Then, of course I should do it.

1642
01:10:36.833 --> 01:10:38.507
We saved the baby

1643
01:10:38.574 --> 01:10:41.470
Wow, weren’t we really cool that day?

1644
01:10:41.537 --> 01:10:42.434
Right, Teacher Oh I-young?

1645
01:10:42.501 --> 01:10:43.510
[Music: 'Someday I'll Be Wise'
‘Life as a Major’ OST]

1646
01:10:43.577 --> 01:10:45.007
(Lee Young) Just what

1647
01:10:45.074 --> 01:10:46.033
(Sanghyun) When I saw

1648
01:10:46.100 --> 01:10:47.843
Teacher Oh I-young was the coolest.
[Sound of opening a beer bottle]

1649
01:10:47.910 --> 01:10:48.711
[Embarrassed laughter]

1650
01:10:48.778 --> 01:10:50.313
(Junseok) But why did you come, teacher?

1651
01:10:51.114 --> 01:10:52.634
(Sanghyun) Oh, you’re really sad?

1652
01:10:52.701 --> 01:10:54.583
I found Mr. Goo Do-won.

1653
01:10:54.650 --> 01:10:56.207
That's the inflection point in this case.

1654
01:10:56.274 --> 01:10:57.620
Of course I should come

1655
01:10:57.687 --> 01:10:58.670
(Mugang) I have to come, I have to come

1656
01:10:58.737 --> 01:10:59.658
open deeper
[Medical staff laugh]

1657
01:10:59.725 --> 01:11:01.840
(Mu-gang) Oh, I’m so impressed with Teacher Goo Do-won.

1658
01:11:01.907 --> 01:11:03.459
I'll tell you about the somaek.

1659
01:11:06.540 --> 01:11:08.235
(Sanghyun) But Teacher Koo Do-won
I see you sometimes, huh?

1660
01:11:08.302 --> 01:11:09.770
He said he was pretending to be the main character of a drama.

1661
01:11:09.837 --> 01:11:11.304
(Mugang) Oh, but I heard it was really cool.

1662
01:11:11.371 --> 01:11:12.534
- (Sanghyun) Really?
- (Mugan) Wait, wait, wait

1663
01:11:12.601 --> 01:11:13.640
Oh I-young

1664
01:11:13.707 --> 01:11:14.603
Roll it deeper

1665
01:11:14.670 --> 01:11:16.110
[Medical staff laugh]

1666
01:11:16.177 --> 01:11:16.992
[No lecture, nose-chewing laughter]

1667
01:11:17.059 --> 01:11:18.745
(Junseok) What are you talking about?
[Sanghyun and Dongho’s laughter]

1668
01:11:18.812 --> 01:11:20.143
(Sanghyun) What is this laughing sound?

1669
01:11:20.210 --> 01:11:22.382
- (Lee Young) Okay, here it is.
- (Together) Oh, thank you.

1670
01:11:22.449 --> 01:11:24.100
- (Mugang) Would you like a drink?
- (Lee Young) Thank you for your hard work.

1671
01:11:24.167 --> 01:11:26.082
Thank you for your hard work (together)!
[Sound of clinking glasses]

1672
01:11:29.608 --> 01:11:31.721
[Sound of medical staff talking]

1673
01:11:33.509 --> 01:11:34.623
(Mugang) No, where are you going, where are you going?

1674
01:11:34.690 --> 01:11:35.607
- (Dongho) Oh, I...
- (Lee Young) I’m this way

1675
01:11:35.674 --> 01:11:36.573
- (Dongho) Yes, I’m here too.
- (Sanghyun) This way, this way

1676
01:11:36.640 --> 01:11:37.640
(Mugang) I’m here too

1677
01:11:37.707 --> 01:11:38.740
- (Sanghyun) Okay, okay
- (Mugang) Then let’s go.

1678
01:11:38.807 --> 01:11:39.740
- (Lee Young) See you tomorrow
- (Sanghyun) I’ll go.

1679
01:11:39.807 --> 01:11:41.898
- See you tomorrow, see you tomorrow, teacher Dongho.
- (Junseok) Go, go

1680
01:11:42.703 --> 01:11:44.838
- (Sanghyun) [Laughing] It suits you well.
- (Mugang) So

1681
01:11:44.905 --> 01:11:46.039
(Junseok) Write, hey

1682
01:11:46.106 --> 01:11:48.740
Dongho, at such a nice restaurant
The day when I get to eat is coming

1683
01:11:48.807 --> 01:11:49.840
(Sanghyun) Oh, really?

1684
01:11:49.907 --> 01:11:51.167
(Mugang) Oh, let’s talk about this in advance.

1685
01:11:51.234 --> 01:11:52.540
How can I make an appointment a day in advance?

1686
01:11:52.607 --> 01:11:53.740
[Sanghyeon’s light smile]
I almost couldn't come.

1687
01:11:53.807 --> 01:11:56.408
(Sanghyun) Oh, that’s a nobleman.
I heard it during the day today

1688
01:11:56.475 --> 01:11:57.551
[Laughing without lecture]
(Junseok) Then what do you think?

1689
01:11:57.618 --> 01:11:59.148
If you get it, it's a big hit, right?

1690
01:12:00.375 --> 01:12:01.574
(Mugang) Teachers, can we have one more drink?

1691
01:12:01.641 --> 01:12:03.774
- (Sanghyun) I need to see that kid.
- (Junseok) I have to work tomorrow.

1692
01:12:03.841 --> 01:12:05.722
(Mugang) I should go home and watch TV too.

1693
01:12:11.231 --> 01:12:12.732
(Dongho) Are you going home?

1694
01:12:12.799 --> 01:12:14.607
(Lee Young) No, the hospital.

1695
01:12:14.674 --> 01:12:16.365
I have to leave my phone and go get it.

1696
01:12:17.099 --> 01:12:18.874
(Dongho) Ah, Sseu-eup

1697
01:12:18.941 --> 01:12:20.236
But today maybe

1698
01:12:20.937 --> 01:12:21.871
Yes?

1699
01:12:21.938 --> 01:12:24.544
Well, I guess we both watch it.

1700
01:12:24.611 --> 01:12:25.675
Isn't it?

1701
01:12:26.213 --> 01:12:27.567
(Dongho) Ah...
[Makes a yuck sound]

1702
01:12:27.634 --> 01:12:29.411
I wonder if they thought I was asking for a date or something.

1703
01:12:29.478 --> 01:12:30.613
Not at all?

1704
01:12:32.141 --> 01:12:33.215
(Lee Young) Just like that

1705
01:12:33.282 --> 01:12:34.467
easily mistaken

1706
01:12:34.534 --> 01:12:37.257
I'm not the kind of person who just misunderstands.
[Lee Young clears his throat]

1707
01:12:37.324 --> 01:12:38.788
Oh, I see.

1708
01:12:40.152 --> 01:12:41.200
No, when I think about it

1709
01:12:41.267 --> 01:12:43.526
I said we all get together
I feel like I didn't say anything.

1710
01:12:43.593 --> 01:12:44.560
Ah!

1711
01:12:45.341 --> 01:12:47.130
It's okay, it was fun

1712
01:12:48.308 --> 01:12:49.198
(Dongho) Yes

1713
01:12:50.637 --> 01:12:52.168
(Lee Young) I really enjoyed it.

1714
01:12:53.273 --> 01:12:54.135
(Dongho) Yes

1715
01:12:55.909 --> 01:12:57.740
But can I ask you something?

1716
01:12:59.375 --> 01:13:00.943
If you don't want to answer, you don't have to.

1717
01:13:02.841 --> 01:13:03.946
Let's listen

1718
01:13:06.774 --> 01:13:08.184
A person who likes teacher Oh I-young

1719
01:13:08.251 --> 01:13:09.707
(Lee Young) [surprised] How did you know?

1720
01:13:09.774 --> 01:13:10.640
[bitter laughter]

1721
01:13:10.707 --> 01:13:11.621
Is that right?

1722
01:13:12.759 --> 01:13:14.467
(Lee Young) No one knows that?

1723
01:13:14.534 --> 01:13:15.991
[light music]

1724
01:13:16.058 --> 01:13:17.507
I didn't tell anyone?

1725
01:13:17.574 --> 01:13:19.834
[Laughing] I didn’t just say anything.
You could see everything?

1726
01:13:19.901 --> 01:13:20.896
[Dongho takes a breath]

1727
01:13:20.963 --> 01:13:23.900
Our place is quite prestigious.

1728
01:13:25.319 --> 01:13:26.773
(Lee Young) Sabi’s discharge party?

1729
01:13:26.840 --> 01:13:28.637
No, I have plans for dinner tomorrow.

1730
01:13:30.573 --> 01:13:32.479
How many times have you said the same thing today?

1731
01:13:32.546 --> 01:13:34.377
Kim Sa-bi came in for surgery instead.

1732
01:13:35.341 --> 01:13:36.241
[Lee Young sighs]

1733
01:13:36.308 --> 01:13:37.451
3 minutes in a row

1734
01:13:37.518 --> 01:13:38.408
[Sound of door opening]

1735
01:13:38.475 --> 01:13:40.640
(Dowon) Have the results of the maternal test been posted?
[Call end tone]

1736
01:13:40.707 --> 01:13:42.084
(Lee Young) Yes, it’s up.

1737
01:13:42.618 --> 01:13:43.485
Here

1738
01:13:43.552 --> 01:13:46.534
(Dowon) Take out the baby today
I'm also going to remove the ovarian cyst.

1739
01:13:46.601 --> 01:13:47.691
[Soft music]

1740
01:13:47.758 --> 01:13:50.726
The size is bigger than expected
It's stuck in the back

1741
01:13:51.607 --> 01:13:53.262
There may be some collusion.

1742
01:13:58.038 --> 01:13:58.898
(Lee Young) Ah

1743
01:13:59.936 --> 01:14:01.941
So, are you removing this lump as well?

1744
01:14:02.008 --> 01:14:03.205
(Dowon) That’s the bladder

1745
01:14:03.272 --> 01:14:05.174
(Lee Young) Oh, that’s right, thank you

1746
01:14:05.241 --> 01:14:07.981
(Do-won) I, Seong and the mother
I'll take a quick look at the operating room.

1747
01:14:08.048 --> 01:14:09.282
(Lee Young) Yes

1748
01:14:09.349 --> 01:14:10.880
[Sound of door opening]

1749
01:14:15.022 --> 01:14:16.553
[Dongho’s light sigh]
[Sound of door closing]

1750
01:14:21.695 --> 01:14:22.758
(Lee Young) Ah...

1751
01:14:23.297 --> 01:14:24.315
I see.

1752
01:14:26.400 --> 01:14:27.655
You can see everything

1753
01:14:29.570 --> 01:14:30.833
[Dongho’s sigh]

1754
01:14:31.839 --> 01:14:33.874
(Dongho) Isn’t it difficult to have one-sided love?

1755
01:14:33.941 --> 01:14:35.542
(Lee Young) It’s hard.

1756
01:14:35.609 --> 01:14:37.707
What I'm smiling about these days is not smiling

1757
01:14:39.847 --> 01:14:40.915
Then

1758
01:14:42.749 --> 01:14:43.955
Can't you stop?

1759
01:14:51.825 --> 01:14:52.906
How about me?

1760
01:15:02.365 --> 01:15:04.367
I've never thought about it

1761
01:15:06.968 --> 01:15:08.270
(Lee Young) More than what you see

1762
01:15:08.337 --> 01:15:10.444
I like it a lot more

1763
01:15:10.511 --> 01:15:11.600
Mr. Gu Do-won

1764
01:15:11.667 --> 01:15:13.538
[Soft Music-Continued]

1765
01:15:16.807 --> 01:15:17.880
sorry

1766
01:15:20.475 --> 01:15:21.784
It's nothing to be sorry about

1767
01:15:24.507 --> 01:15:25.855
(Dongho) I understood well.

1768
01:15:26.627 --> 01:15:27.556
Then

1769
01:15:30.693 --> 01:15:32.628
I hope things don't work out for you two, whatever.

1770
01:15:33.141 --> 01:15:34.063
(Lee Young) Yes?

1771
01:15:34.668 --> 01:15:36.399
(Dongho) Ah, if things go well, my stomach hurts.

1772
01:15:37.237 --> 01:15:38.163
(Lee Young) Well...

1773
01:15:39.174 --> 01:15:42.767
(Dongho) Ah, from now on, I will be teacher Oh I-young.
Looks like the operating room is open, Chi.

1774
01:15:42.834 --> 01:15:44.440
(Lee Young) Oh, that’s not possible.

1775
01:15:44.507 --> 01:15:46.107
I don't know, it's my heart

1776
01:15:46.174 --> 01:15:48.066
Wow, teacher, you are really narrow-minded.

